	quest.006F6E0EF5D249AF.quest_desc: [
		"Plant a small flower inside a &3Focal Point&f and it will slowly turn into a &3Luminous Flower&f of that &bConstellation&f. Dropping the flower as an item also works, but takes longer. Each &3Focal Point&f only makes the flower for its own &bConstellation&f."
		""
		"- &bAevitas&f: Hyacinth"
		"- &3Armara&f: Orchid"
		"- &bDiscidia&f: Thistle"
		"- &3Evorsio&f: Protea"
		"- &bVicio&f: Iris"
		""
		"You'll eventually need all five, which means finding five different &3Focal Points&f."
	]
	quest.006F6E0EF5D249AF.title: "&3Luminous Flowers"
	quest.0085136101DB1F9A.quest_desc: ["Horse Viruses can be used to summon undead horses. Obtain both the Necrodermal and Nullodermal variants."]
	quest.0085136101DB1F9A.quest_subtitle: "Summons undead horses"
	quest.0085136101DB1F9A.title: "Horse Viruses"
	quest.0089B6C20C45DDCA.quest_desc: ["The smeltery applies Fortune IV when smelting ores! "]
	quest.0089B6C20C45DDCA.quest_subtitle: "Fortune IV"
	quest.008CCF15712A0E0A.quest_subtitle: "The Schemer Who Treats It All as a Chessboard"
	quest.008CCF15712A0E0A.title: "Kill Yuuki"
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_desc: [
		"The Guard Tower will employ and house one Guard to protect your colony. Your citizens will appreciate a well guarded colony. A general rule of thumb is two guards for every three citizens."
		""
		"Guards sleep in guard dowers, freeing up the bed they previously occupied in a residence or tavern allowing you to recruit new colonists. "
		""
		"Tip: You can expand your colony border by building and leveling up guard towers."
	]
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_subtitle: "Build a Guard Tower and Hire a Guard"
	quest.00DB12A9AF2C1FFD.quest_subtitle: "Trade or Slaughter?"
	quest.00F10FDD120BC630.quest_desc: ["Simply right click the &6Item Drain&r with a &6Mechanical Grindstone&r and then place another on top of it and you'll be able to grind away the enchantments into &aliquid experience&r."]
	quest.00F10FDD120BC630.quest_subtitle: "Stations to clean your &atools and weapons&r of their enchantments or &epolish some quartz&r"
	quest.00F10FDD120BC630.title: "&8Grindstone and Item Drain"
	quest.00F6AB7FE28D6835.quest_desc: [
		"The &3Starlight Infuser&f infuses items with starlight pulled from the ring of &bLiquid Starlight&f pools built into its structure rather than the sky, so it works day or night and under a roof."
		""
		"Right-click it with an item to set it, fill every pool in the ring, then Right-click it with the &aResonating Wand&f to start crafting. Every pool has to stay full for the whole craft or it won't run."
		""
		"A &3Containment Chalice&f in range is drained instead of the pools."
	]
	quest.00F6AB7FE28D6835.title: "&3Starlight Infuser"
	quest.0112B2610FEAE051.quest_desc: [
		"1. A creature named by a player through the Tensura naming system is killed by an entity other than that player."
		"2. Reach 25,000 Soul Points."
		""
		"In multiplayer, only one player may own this skill. To remove this restriction, use /gamerule satanaelTrulyUnique false"
	]
