	quest.045C81345A1B6BEB.quest_desc: [
		"A starlight source only reaches a short distance in a straight line. A &dLens&f takes starlight from any number of links and passes it to one target. A &5Prism&f splits what it receives evenly between every target it's linked to."
		""
		"Both are built around a &3Crystal&f, and the lower its purity, the more starlight is lost at each relay. A long chain of low-purity relays delivers almost nothing."
	]
	quest.045C81345A1B6BEB.title: "&dLens and Prism"
	quest.04AB969794B55A42.quest_desc: ["&6Dropped by Rimuru, Supermassive Slimes, and Luminous. &rConsuming it grants 10 minutes of accelerated skill learning. If you possess Great Sage, Sage, Wisdom King, or Fortune King: Fortuna, it also grants skill mastery. If you possess Fortune King: Fortuna, consuming 10 lets you lock this Ultimate Skill on the “Lock” screen, preventing it from being lost upon reincarnation."]
	quest.04AB969794B55A42.quest_subtitle: "Keep this skill active."
	quest.04BB306C8A17149A.quest_desc: ["The Rod of the Highlands places blocks at a distance, making it useful for building across gaps or reaching high places."]
