	quest.0A78354A482CA2D2.quest_desc: [
		"Make a backpack to expand your inventory. The backpack can be equipped in the accessory slot using shortcut keys.&6(H key)&ropen backpack"
		"The backpack can be upgraded to an Ultimate Metal Backpack by killing monsters to gain EP!"
	]
	quest.0A78354A482CA2D2.quest_subtitle: "I'm so full... I can't eat another bite!"
	quest.0A78354A482CA2D2.title: "&6【Side Quest】&r Hey, I Can't Eat Another Bite!"
	quest.0AF699444809DBDD.quest_desc: "This item has three times the capacity of an Aura Cache and can store a large amount of Aura."
	quest.0AF699444809DBDD.quest_subtitle: "Store more Aura."
	quest.0B009391E3F76D6E.quest_desc: [
		"The fisher is an excellent source of early game food for your citizens. Hopefully you have a decent resource for string. With any luck the fisherman will also get some some extra loot. "
		""
		"If your colony lacks a natural water source like an ocean or river, you can make do with a 6x6x1 area of water. "
	]
	quest.0B009391E3F76D6E.quest_subtitle: "Build the Fisher's Hut"
	quest.0B21F09A559B332C.quest_desc: [
		"Modified Pasture Seeds grow colorful varieties of fantasy grass. Each seed produces a different ground cover."
		""
		"This objective tracks Golden Pasture Seeds."
	]
	quest.0B21F09A559B332C.title: "Fantasy Pasture Seeds"
	quest.0B45B06246AC854D.quest_desc: [
		"&lTo make this weapon you will need:&r"
		"{ \"text\": \"Smithing Bench\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"5E173415DC087BC4\" } }"
		""
		"And unlock the wand blueprint"
		""
		"Special evolution: There are 3 unique evolution stages, each evolution increases attack damage"
		"52000 EP: Attack damage +13"
		"225000 EP: Attack damage +15"
		"750000 EP: Attack damage +29"
	]
	quest.0B45B06246AC854D.quest_subtitle: "Right click to summon, left click to attack, mage warrior?"
	quest.0B45B06246AC854D.title: "&6【Boss Hunt①】&r Summon the Slime Army"
	quest.0B4B5C864F6D5BBB.quest_desc: [
		"Throw an &dEnder Pearl&f, 2 &aAquamarine&f, and 2 &2Marble&f into a &3Focal Point&f to craft your very first astral tool."
		""
		"The &aResonating Wand&f makes buried &2Rock Crystal&f sparkle through solid stone, starts starlight devices when you Right-click them, and draws a ghost of the missing blocks when a structure isn't finished."
	]
	quest.0B4B5C864F6D5BBB.title: "&aResonating Wand"
	quest.0B5F248E6E8FB4FE.quest_desc: [
		"The function is similar to the Eye of Ender, it can find the structure of the Boss"
		""
		"&6Starlight Flowers are easier to find in Starlight Forest or Starlight Thicket.&r"
	]
	quest.0B5F248E6E8FB4FE.quest_subtitle: "Find Puppet Foundry and Cursed Garden"
	quest.0B625F1182B5E4A4.quest_subtitle: "How can you stir-fry without a pot?"
	quest.0B62BEC857573993.quest_subtitle: "A Little Weaker than Diamond Armor"
	quest.0B62BEC857573993.title: "Arashi Snake Suit"
	quest.0B75860976DB9B43.quest_subtitle: "A &6Radial Chassis&r is a useful block for building contraptions"
	quest.0B75860976DB9B43.title: "Obtain Radial Chassis"
	quest.0B7AF2C4B603A41F.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.0B958A2BBD37292D.quest_desc: [
		"Just press and hold the right button to face the enemy, and you can also use the left button to chop down trees. It's a two-in-one weapon and tool."
		"&6Default EP: 0"
		"&6Killing creatures can increase EP, but weapons cannot evolve."
	]
	quest.0B958A2BBD37292D.quest_subtitle: "Crush Your Enemies"
	quest.0B992C3C64DCBDFD.quest_subtitle: "An Ancient Tree That Increases Aura"
	quest.0B992C3C64DCBDFD.title: "Add More Aura to Your Surroundings!"
	quest.0BC3C85CABC897FD.quest_desc: [
		"When you kill a creature, you gain 3% of its EP. Skills such as Predator and Great Sage can increase the amount of EP you gain and may also let you obtain the creature's skills."
		"&5For non-demons, 2/3 of the EP gained is converted into AP (Aura), and the remaining 1/3 is converted into MP (Magicules).&r &bFor demons, 2/3 is converted into MP (Magicules), and 1/3 is converted into AP (Aura).&r"
		""
		"It should be easy for you, though, if you choose a race with a high starting value..."
	]
	quest.0BC3C85CABC897FD.quest_subtitle: "How to get EP quickly?"
	quest.0BC3C85CABC897FD.title: "&6【Main Story】&r EP Reaches 3,000"
	quest.0BCAAE3D64E3FF14.quest_subtitle: "A &6Schedule&r lets you schedule trains so that mobs or &6Blaze Burners&r can drive them"
	quest.0BCAAE3D64E3FF14.title: "Obtain Schedule"
	quest.0BCFC6EC4EA3ECD4.quest_subtitle: "&6Ultima's Table"
	quest.0BD750F86B0EA265.title: "{translate:\"task.A1F2E3D4C5B60198.title\"}"
	quest.0BE594C503C526D1.quest_desc: ["Raven Feathers are dropped by ravens, usually found near obsidian pillars."]
	quest.0BE594C503C526D1.quest_subtitle: "Magic Map!"
	quest.0BE594C503C526D1.title: "[Optional] Make a Map of the Boss Structure"
	quest.0BEB6A697B32E311.quest_subtitle: "&7Common"
	quest.0BEB6A697B32E311.title: "Catch Salmon"
	quest.0BEDF37489C0CD4D.quest_desc: ["&6Default EP: 2000, cannot evolve"]
	quest.0BEDF37489C0CD4D.quest_subtitle: "Raging Flames"
	quest.0C345577043D3630.title: "Help the Dragon Grow Faster!"
	quest.0C3C1757487FC282.quest_desc: [
		"Possess a weakened physical body to enter a whole new world"
		"How to Use"
		"&lActive Skill&r If used while possessing a body, the user leaves that body behind along with its intrinsic skills and enters Spiritual Form. Unless it is the original body, the abandoned body disappears after 5 minutes to prevent lag. While in Spiritual Form, the user can possess targets that meet the following requirements: [Does not work on targets with Spiritual Attack Nullification enabled]"
		""
		"&l- Non-player monsters: &r"
		"Health below 10%, Spiritual Health below 10%, or maximum EP below 25% of the user's maximum EP. If the target has Spiritual Attack Resistance enabled, the requirements are reduced to 5% Health, 5% Spiritual Health, or 12.5% maximum EP."
		""
		"&l- Players:&r Must meet 2 of the 3 optional requirements above. If possessed, the target player enters Spiritual Form and will eventually die without the [Possession] skill."
		"When possessing a target, the user returns to Physical Form with the target's physical attributes and skills."
		""
		"&lWarning: When using this skill, held items and armor remain on the old body.&r"
		""
		"&lFriendly Reminder:&r Open the old body's inventory to retrieve those items."
		"When changing bodies through [Possession], only status effects with the \"spiritual affected\" tag are transferred; other normal status effects do not move with the soul."
	]
	quest.0C3C1757487FC282.quest_subtitle: "Your Innate Skill"
	quest.0C3C1757487FC282.title: "Possession"
	quest.0C59E0866E7EFBF3.quest_subtitle: "A &6Portable Fluid Interface&r allows contraptions to transfer fluids to blocks"
	quest.0C59E0866E7EFBF3.title: "Obtain Portable Fluid Interface"
	quest.0C5CB0025C8F81AC.quest_desc: "Right-click the Aegis to activate a 10-minute buff. It reduces time freezes and barrage damage, prevents the Boss from healing, and blocks forced teleportation. You can fight without the Aegis, but the battle will be extremely difficult."
	quest.0C7E6662CD32D710.quest_subtitle: "&6Ultima's Table"
	quest.0C96C27A7AA7FF13.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.0CAB66227F82B28F.quest_desc: [
		"Consult the Book of Natural Aura, then set up the Offering Table and 36 small flowers of any type (preferably outdoors in the open air!)."
		""
		"You need a Spirit of Calling to use the Offering Table!"
		"Right-click the bowl with the materials, then take one step back and throw the Spirit of Calling into the flower circle. After a short wait, “lightning” will take the offering away, and materials will fall from the sky a little later."
	]
	quest.0CAB66227F82B28F.quest_subtitle: "God, please take notice."
	quest.0CCA7E205A8E324E.quest_subtitle: "&bDemanding Dish"
	quest.0D1E2F3A4B5C6789.title: "{translate:\"task.0D1E2F3A4B5C6780.title\"}"
	quest.0D45D9EEFC4B10AB.quest_desc: [
		"The &aTome&f is &eAstral Sorcery's&f guidebook. Its pages unlock as you progress through the mod."
		""
		"Once you've memorized a &bConstellation&f, Sneak + Right-click the &aTome&f to get a new &bConstellation Paper&f for it. You'll need one later at the &3Attunement Altar&f."
	]
	quest.0D45D9EEFC4B10AB.title: "&aTome"
	quest.0D5283F0B13D6034.quest_desc: ["The Rod of the Plentiful Mantle briefly reveals nearby ores, helping you find useful deposits while exploring."]
	quest.0D5283F0B13D6034.quest_subtitle: "Briefly reveals nearby ores"
	quest.0D5283F0B13D6034.title: "Rod of the Plentiful Mantle"
	quest.0D56E3C121A776DF.quest_desc: ["Undertaker Revived a Dead Citizen"]
	quest.0D5E9B37A4F12C86.quest_subtitle: "Requires one of the unique Seven Deadly Sins skills to unlock this branch."
	quest.0D6E099A1A242153.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBuild Tool&r is one of the most important tools in the mod. It's how you will place all building from now on. Right+click any solid item to open the build preview GUI. On the right are controls for moving, rotating, raising, and lowering your building. "
		""
		"Place your &bTown Hall&r block and register your colony. However, the first building to be constructed is the builders hut. Your Town Hall cannot be built until you have a completed builders hut."
	]
	quest.0D81D76098C52BEB.title: "&e【Exchange】&f Loot Schematics"
	quest.0D960805EE9F7AA5.quest_desc: [
		"To activate the sleeping Harbinger, you must first defeat the Wither to obtain the Nether Star and then right-click the Harbinger."
		"It has two stages like Wither, and in the second stage its attack damage will be increased."
		""
		"&6Skills it possesses: invalidating heat attacks, invalidating corrosion, invalidating abnormal conditions, invalidating wind attacks, body strengthening, steel strengthening and super speed regeneration"
	]
	quest.0D960805EE9F7AA5.quest_subtitle: "Wisdom of the Ancients"
	quest.0D960805EE9F7AA5.title: "Crusade Harbinger"
	quest.0DA9EA203D43A4E0.title: "Geode Crystal Shards"
	quest.0DAE7D37108791B1.quest_desc: ["The Key of King's Law is a ranged weapon that attacks multiple targets with a distinctive sweeping strike."]
	quest.0DAE7D37108791B1.title: "Key of King's Law"
	quest.0DD9115CFFC15A74.quest_desc: ["Bind a Mana Mirror to a Mana Pool to draw mana from it at a distance. It offers another way to recharge mana-using equipment without carrying a tablet."]
	quest.0DD9115CFFC15A74.title: "Mana Mirror"
	quest.0E105E703E79C81B.quest_desc: [
		"A standard &eMagic Engine&r can be used to prevent mobs from spawning, though that's not it's primary purpose. It's primary purpose is in &oreducing the magicules in an area&r, which can effectively turn inhospitable locations hospitable."
		""
		"When the &bamount of magicules in an area reaches 10 or less&r, it becomes impossible for new life to be born, and those without strong souls and an abundance of magicules will find living in such a location stifling. As such, Magic Engines are a great way to prevent yourself from being assailed by mobs—but there's a catch."
		""
		"Standard magic engines only have an output of &b16 blocks&r. Labyrinth magic engines &bincrease this upward limit to 3&r2. But regardless of their range, each magic engine only &breduces the amount of magicules within range by 1000&r, meaning that multiple magic engines may need to be lined up to bring down the magicule count of a very magical area, such as an &aAncient Forest&r."
		""
		"Another more insidious consequence of having active magic engines running is that it prevents all mobs from spawning—including passive and neutral mobs you may find helpful. In cases where these downsides matter, &ethere is another&r..."
	]
	quest.0E105E703E79C81B.quest_subtitle: "Reduce the concentration of Magicules around you."
	quest.0E105E703E79C81B.title: "Keep the Mobs Away: Magic Engine!"
	quest.0E185842079057DA.quest_subtitle: "【Mastery】"
	quest.0E185842079057DA.title: "&6【Advanced】&f Obtain the Unique Skill Sniper"
	quest.0E2CFFE14441FB44.quest_desc: ["After killing a dragon, right-click it with an empty hand to obtain this item."]
	quest.0E2CFFE14441FB44.quest_subtitle: "Obtained from a slain dragon."
	quest.0E40614E1212A8E7.quest_desc: [
		"Keep hunting monsters to gain EP; defeating a few should be manageable."
		"This is a turning point. At 6,000 EP, you should have unlocked some Skills. Choose the ones that suit you and learn them!"
		""
	]
	quest.0E40614E1212A8E7.title: "&6【Main Story】&r EP Reaches 5,000"
	quest.0E4A2C7FB4B21F4F.quest_desc: ["Restores 10% MP after drinking"]
	quest.0E4A2C7FB4B21F4F.quest_subtitle: "Obtained from the alchemy dwarf."
	quest.0E4E2A348018B02E.quest_desc: [
		"&8In ancient times, two races ruled the overworld."
		"&8One day, a war broke out between the two, and the war soon came to an end. In order to eradicate the roots, the victor sent powerful mages to tear apart the space, created a replica of the main world, imprisoned the defeated party in it, and imposed various curses..."
		"&8Because of the curse, the time of this Dimension is forever locked at dusk, stars are dying, and ether liquid falls from the sky; perhaps the disaster inspired people's desire for survival, or perhaps the punishment promoted people's hatred. Instead of dying, the exiled people established their own civilization. They called themselves \"Starlight People\" and focused on developing magic, hoping to make a comeback one day..."
		"&8In the end, the giant fell, but the damage caused could not be reversed; the Starlight people made a desperate move and tried to use ancient magic to open the portal to the main world; they seemed to succeed, a dark door glowing with purple light opened, and before there was any time to think, the survivors swarmed in..."
		"&8Some plants are affected by magic and take on magical elements, becoming very different from their ancestors.&r"
	]
	quest.0E4E2A348018B02E.quest_subtitle: "\"A Replica of the Main World\""
	quest.0E557D8BB429060D.title: "{translate:\"task.EE5F6A7B8C9D0124.title\"}"
	quest.0E730265DCC768E6.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.0E80325865685EE6.quest_desc: [
		"[ { \"text\": \"Understand the reputation system first\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"56413501A9E9D8FC\" } } ]"
		""
		"When your DR reaches -100 or 100, you can use the Teleport Slab in the Royal Tower to go to the Gazel Dwargo boss fight."
		""
		"&6When you are -100DR"
		"You will use the Teleport Slab as a criminal and be personally executed by the King. You must defeat Gazel Dwargo to obtain the Five-Petal Strike Manual. After that, you will not be able to use this Teleport Slab again."
		""
		"&6When you are 100DR&r"
		"You will use the Teleport Slab as a friend of the Dwarf Kingdom and be personally greeted by the King. You can treat this battle as training; if you win, he will give you the Five-Petal Strike for free. Even after winning, players can still return to challenge him later."
	]
	quest.0E80325865685EE6.title: "Challenge the Dwarf King"
	quest.0EBB4E5195610A82.quest_desc: ["The Sawmill is where the Carpenter will craft any items made of at least 75% wood. This is the point where the colony really starts to feel like it’s running on its own. Be sure to set up important recipes for items your builder regularly needs. While the sawmill starts with a paltry 10 recipes, the number of recipes you can teach the Sawmill doubles per building level."]
	quest.0EBB4E5195610A82.quest_subtitle: "Build a Sawmill"
	quest.0EBE27426C61AA36.quest_desc: "Caught the Legendary rarity fish Alpha Fish."
	quest.0EBE27426C61AA36.quest_subtitle: "&6&lLegendary"
	quest.0EBE27426C61AA36.title: "Catch Alpha Fish"
	quest.0ECF6A73AFA16B0D.quest_subtitle: "&6Cogwheels&r are used to either increase rotational speed or extend contraptions depending on the way they're facing. Play around with the sizes of the cogwheels and see what you can make out of them"
	quest.0ECF6A73AFA16B0D.title: "Cogwheels"
	quest.0F2F0A538E65B228.quest_subtitle: "A &cSmart Observer&r can look for specific items in the world or in inventories"
	quest.0F2F0A538E65B228.title: "Obtain Content Observer"
	quest.0F3129D294DAFC1B.quest_desc: [
		"Right-clicking a dragon hatched from a dragon egg can make the dragon sit, stand up, or follow"
		"Sneaking and right-clicking on a dragon sets the dragon's home to its current coordinates."
	]
	quest.0F3129D294DAFC1B.quest_subtitle: "Control your dragon."
	quest.0F315FD3B94735A5.quest_subtitle: "A &6Train Station&r is the block that deals with train assembly and disassembly"
	quest.0F315FD3B94735A5.title: "Obtain Track Station"
	quest.0F409DACBEB7BBF8.quest_desc: ["Depending on the pack style you choose, supply ships may need to be placed in water, or in the air. Clear an area large enough to fit your supply ship. This may include digging under water, depending on where you place your ship. The supply ship will not place if there are objects in the way. Right clicking the supply ship on the ground will show a 3D preview of the camp. Using the placement controls arrows, position the ship in your clearing, then click the green checkmark to finalize the placement. If it won’t place, then the terrain is in the way, and you may need to clear the area more. Red lines will appear showing you the areas that need to be cleared."]
	quest.0F4B54C71BF36F07.title: "&6【Advanced】&f Obtain the Unique Skill Wrath"
	quest.0F617A990DB2CD19.quest_desc: ["The Shard of Laputa raises a section of ground into the air. Use it to create elevated terrain."]
	quest.0F617A990DB2CD19.quest_subtitle: "Raises a section of ground into the air"
	quest.0F617A990DB2CD19.title: "Shard of Laputa"
	quest.0F76470B53D09466.title: "&eHoney Candy"
	quest.0F7DF9F8B161AD3F.title: "Obtain Fan Splashing Catalyst"
	quest.0FBF8D0B672B3247.quest_desc: [
		"&8Before starting the fight, prepare:"
		"The most important thing is not the armor, but these:"
		"&8A large number of blood recovery props"
		"Because a lot of its damage is real damage, armor and damage reduction are basically useless."
		"&8an ax"
		"Specifically used to fight Mercy Crystal."
		"&8Do not bring flying/double jumping props"
		"Because of the \"ionized airspace\", it will continue to lose blood when flying high, and will die suddenly when the blood is low."
	]
	quest.0FBF8D0B672B3247.quest_subtitle: "What You Need to Know"
	quest.0FC666681CCE2617.title: "{translate:\"task.CC3D4E5F6A7B8902.title\"}"
	quest.0FDA8DE439A0FC25.quest_desc: [
		"&4(To disable this system, enter: &c/gamerule uniqueSECost false&4)"
		""
		"&6[Soul Energy] &fis randomly generated when you reincarnate for the first time, with a value between 500,000 and 7,000,000. Your initial amount is guaranteed to be enough to obtain your first Unique Skill."
		""
		"Soul Energy is not randomized again by reset scrolls or other scrolls. When your character is reset, your current Soul Energy returns to your Soul Energy maximum. Only specific actions can permanently increase that maximum."
		""
		"Obtaining a new Unique Skill consumes an amount of Soul Energy based on the Skill's strength. You cannot obtain the Skill if you do not have enough Soul Energy."
		""
		"Initial Soul Energy probabilities:"
		"65%: 500,000–1,000,000"
		"25%: 1,000,000–2,000,000"
		"6%: 2,000,000–3,000,000"
		"2%: 3,000,000–4,000,000"
		"1%: 4,000,000–5,000,000"
		"0.5%: 5,000,000–6,000,000"
		"0.3%: 6,000,000–6,500,000"
		"0.2%: 6,500,000–7,000,000"
		""
		"&6Triggering an Awakening event grants 500,000–1,000,000 Soul Energy. Awakening can be triggered again after each reset."
		""
		"&6Completing a Reset Counter quest grants 500,000–1,000,000 Soul Energy."
		""
		"&6Being named permanently increases your Soul Energy maximum. Self-naming can grant up to 250,000 Soul Energy. If another player names you, the amount depends on how much more Soul Energy the namer has than you, up to 1,000,000. You may receive no Soul Energy if the namer's amount is equal to or lower than yours. This naming bonus can only be received once and cannot be triggered again after a reset."
		""
		"Command to check &6[Soul Energy]&f:"
		"&7/mysticism get stat &fYourNameHere &7soulEnergy current"
	]
	quest.0FDA8DE439A0FC25.quest_subtitle: "This is important for learning your unique abilities."
	quest.0FDA8DE439A0FC25.title: "Soul Energy System"
	quest.100B138878B70743.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.101A949B0726CD74.quest_desc: [
		"Pasture Seeds can be used to make Botania flowers float, allowing them to be placed away from ordinary grass."
		""
		"This objective tracks a Floating Endoflame."
	]
	quest.101A949B0726CD74.title: "Floating Flowers"
	quest.101F636AC88EA48C.quest_desc: [
		"If you want to survive in this world, you must become stronger. Let's try hunting down a few monsters first."
		""
		"Monster Leather can be obtained in the wild by killing &oLizards, Dog Demons, and Fang Clans&r, as well as obtained by other means"
		"Slime balls can be obtained by killing Slime &o(there are more monsters in forests or plains)&r"
		""
		"What? Is your race too weak to kill them? No worries, use a \"boat\" to immobilize them."
	]
	quest.101F636AC88EA48C.quest_subtitle: "Get initial resources!"
	quest.101F636AC88EA48C.title: "&6【Main Story】&r Kill Monsters"
	quest.1046211A6B00FE3A.quest_subtitle: "Make food filled with magicules!"
	quest.1048338B290654F5.quest_subtitle: "Relics Buried Underground"
	quest.1048338B290654F5.title: "Find the Mercy Arena"
	quest.1064C42904A3BF6C.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.10BF630559FD74EA.quest_desc: ["&6Default EP: 2000, cannot evolve"]
	quest.10C57B245C83B5AA.title: "&5The Bright Side"
	quest.10D7C5874FF7E693.quest_subtitle: "A &6Train Observer&r gives off a &credstone signal&r when detecting a train"
	quest.10D7C5874FF7E693.title: "&dTrain Observer"
	quest.11783FF7C73C9DC3.quest_desc: [
		"Right click to continuously fire laser"
		"&6Default EP: 0, up to 10,000"
		"&6Killing creatures can increase EP, but weapons cannot evolve."
	]
	quest.11783FF7C73C9DC3.quest_subtitle: "Da Da Da"
	quest.1185C19C5EE08F61.quest_subtitle: "【Mastery】"
	quest.1185C19C5EE08F61.title: "&6【Advanced】&f Obtain the Unique Skill Tuner"
	quest.118FAB1F433F17BA.quest_desc: [
		"You can use this as a pickaxe to mine magic ore fragments."
		"&6Default EP: 0"
		"&6Killing creatures can increase EP, but cannot evolve."
	]
	quest.118FAB1F433F17BA.quest_subtitle: "Dropped by Netherite Monstrosity"
	quest.11A16F0A491A86A9.quest_subtitle: "Powdered Gold Leaf"
	quest.11A83C8745383917.quest_subtitle: "&9Rare"
	quest.11A83C8745383917.title: "Catch Dragonfish"
	quest.11EAA6665DE956FF.quest_subtitle: "&6Chutes&r are used to transfer items between inventories vertically, either with gravity downwards or Encased Fan airflow upwards"
	quest.11EAA6665DE956FF.title: "Obtain Chute"
	quest.11EFF91EE011DFF6.title: "{translate:\"task.F6A7B8C9D0E12355.title\"}"
	quest.120152510AD4B59A.quest_desc: ["While you might think your builder needs glasses sometimes, these goggles won’t help them. The Builders googles are for you. When you put them on your head or in a curio head slot they allow you to preview your buildings at level 5 which is helpful when fitting one building next to another."]
	quest.129638DFCD29D823.quest_subtitle: "Submit after obtaining the corresponding elf."
	quest.129638DFCD29D823.title: "Wind Elf·High Level"
	quest.129C3092F055B640.title: "Oni Lord"
	quest.12AC27D1104A4805.quest_subtitle: "&bDemanding Dish"
	quest.12B1D45C91AFEAEB.quest_desc: ["Restores 1000MP after drinking"]
	quest.12B1D45C91AFEAEB.quest_subtitle: "Ordinary Potion, Not Boiled"
	quest.12D0B21E10AEEDB4.quest_desc: [
		"The &cKinetic Battery&r stores &6Stress Units&r for later use. This way it allows you to have a source of a limited amount of &6Stress Units&r whenever necessary without the need for a new setup each time. But to use this block for your needs first you will need to &ccharge&r it"
		""
		"The &cKinetic Battery&r charges itself by consuming &6SU&r from the grid it is connected to whenever it &l&4is not&r powered on, and uses that charge to provide &6SU&r to the connected grid whenever &2&lit is&r powered on "
	]
	quest.12D0B21E10AEEDB4.title: "&5How to charge the Kinetic Battery"
	quest.12E7EFE9B3A1B5A7.quest_desc: [
		"Did you know? Equipment made from leather imbued with Magicule&6(Grade C)&ris no inferior to iron armor, and can even surpass it! The equipment can also be upgraded!"
		"&cGrade C (5kEP) -> Grade B (8kEP) -> Grade A (8wEP) -> Special Grade A&r"
		"&8(You cannot check how many upgrades are left or how much EP you currently have. The EP on the equipment is only used as durability)&r"
	]
	quest.12E7EFE9B3A1B5A7.quest_subtitle: "Leather with Magicule"
	quest.12E7EFE9B3A1B5A7.title: "&6【Side Quest·Benefits】&r Monster Leather Set?"
	quest.12F18B429DF60C4B.quest_subtitle: "&9Rare"
	quest.12F18B429DF60C4B.title: "Catch Frostbite Flounder"
	quest.130E8FC7479E4271.quest_desc: [
		"The Shepherd’s Hut is where the Shepherd will breed and butcher sheep for food and wool. You will have to capture and bring in two sheep to the Shepherd’s Hut, as the Shepherd will not catch and bring in any sheep."
		""
		"The Shepherd will only keep two sheep alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten sheep in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.130E8FC7479E4271.quest_subtitle: "Build a Sheperd's Hut"
	quest.131BE03E626D5661.quest_desc: ["This structure generates only in the Nether. Use the Eye of Flame to locate it."]
	quest.131BE03E626D5661.quest_subtitle: "A Structure Built in the Nether"
	quest.131BE03E626D5661.title: "Go to Arena of Fire"
	quest.132C28EB0CB4D7BF.quest_desc: [
		"The &3Resonating Crafting Table&f can be upgraded in place again by upgrading its structure with the outer ring of relays from the full Resonating structure, &aStardust&f thrown on the ground nearby, and &bLiquid Starlight&f from &3Containment Chalices&f. The &bTome's&f structure page shows the full layout."
		""
		"When it finishes, the table becomes the &dLuminous Crafting Altar&f and a new tier of the &bTome&f opens."
		""
		"This new altar has a &bConstellation&f focus slot next to the grid, which when provided with an &3Attuned Crystal&f will tune the recipe to that &bConstellation&f."
		""
		"Some recipes consume the focus when they finish. The recipe page in the &bTome&f shows which ones, so check before using your best &3Crystal&f."
	]
	quest.132C28EB0CB4D7BF.quest_subtitle: "Unlocks Starlight Focus Crystals and Lumen Alchemy"
	quest.132C28EB0CB4D7BF.title: "&dLuminous Crafting Altar"
	quest.135EA2FF73DEFEC8.quest_desc: [
		"Prepare to summon the Gaia Guardian by gathering four Gaia Pylons, a Beacon, a Terrasteel Ingot, and Life Essence."
		""
		"Consult the Lexica Botania for the arena ritual and its requirements before beginning the challenge."
	]
	quest.135EA2FF73DEFEC8.title: "Preparing for the Gaia Guardian"
	quest.138625D83CAE9E7C.quest_subtitle: "Submit after obtaining the corresponding elf."
	quest.138625D83CAE9E7C.title: "Fire Elf·High Level"
	quest.139C40496643C9CC.quest_desc: ["Master 【Mathematician】 and 【Usurper】, be a True Hero or True Demon Lord, and have at least 500,000 Magicules."]
	quest.139C40496643C9CC.quest_subtitle: "Requirements ↓"
	quest.139C40496643C9CC.title: "&6【Advanced】&f Ultimate Skill: Fortune King: Fortuna"
	quest.13D833C11A71B131.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to feed the &6Blaze Forger&r and the &6Blaze Enchanter&r"
	quest.13D833C11A71B131.title: "&2Block of Experience"
	quest.13E519C96A1997A0.quest_desc: [
		"The &2Starmetal Chisel&f is used on dropped items, not blocks. Drop a &2Starmetal Ingot&f on the ground and hit it with the chisel to get &aStardust&f."
		""
		"Hitting a dropped &3Crystal&f the same way splits it in two, losing some quality. A &3Crystal&f that's too weak won't split."
		""
		"&aStardust&f is another core crafting component used in almost everything from here on."
		""
		"&7&oThe chisel only takes Unbreaking and Fortune, and Fortune reduces the losses"
	]
	quest.13E519C96A1997A0.title: "&aStardust"
	quest.13F75BBA354326C2.quest_subtitle: "&7Common"
	quest.13F75BBA354326C2.title: "Catch Searing Cod"
	quest.14AC04DF8CDFD067.quest_desc: [
		"&6You need 5,000,000 EP to enter the portal inside the church and travel to this dimension."
		""
		"Feldway can be found there. He is one of the \"Seven Original Angels\" created by the Star-King Dragon Veldanava, the first among them to be born and an exceptionally powerful being."
	]
	quest.14AC04DF8CDFD067.quest_subtitle: "Abandoned Church in the Plains"
	quest.14CD486EE27C60B3.quest_subtitle: "Place the Magic Water Bottle in the furnace to \"boil it hot\"."
	quest.14CD486EE27C60B3.title: "Magic Water Bottle After Firing"
	quest.14DA3DC7C0009A6A.quest_subtitle: "Reach 50 Citizens"
	quest.14DF20843C746694.quest_subtitle: "Demon Lord on the Tower"
	quest.14FBB5D65C324838.quest_desc: [
		"Each &dIridescent Shifting Star&f is tied to one &bConstellation&f. Using it moves your attunement to that &bConstellation&f while keeping all the experience you've earned."
		""
		"Hold Right-click for a few seconds to use it. Your perks are reset and you pick them again along the new path, but nothing else is lost."
	]
	quest.14FBB5D65C324838.title: "&dIridescent Shifting Stars"
	quest.14FDC94F92D33210.quest_subtitle: "&2Uncommon"
	quest.14FDC94F92D33210.title: "Catch Catfish"
	quest.15009A4C69307199.quest_desc: "&6Has an 80% chance to drop from Rimuru. &rIf you have Gluttonous King, consuming 10 of these lets you lock this Ultimate Skill on the \"Lock\" screen, preventing it from being lost through reincarnation."
	quest.15009A4C69307199.quest_subtitle: "Keep this skill status."
	quest.15111134B4245381.quest_subtitle: "&2Uncommon"
	quest.15111134B4245381.title: "Catch Obsidianfish"
	quest.1521D92CB87B0654.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.153144F8AB0A4349.quest_desc: [
		"&bGems&r are upgradeable crystals that grant bonuses when placed into a compatible &eSocket&r. The same Gem can have different effects depending on the equipment it is fitted into."
		""
		"Affix Items may generate with Sockets according to their rarity. A &6Sigil of Socketing&r can add sockets to an item, up to a maximum of two."
		""
		"To fit a Gem, combine it with the item in a Smithing Table, or hold the Gem and right-click the item in your inventory. Check the Gem's description to see which item types accept it."
		""
		"Gems can be found in chest loot and may rarely drop from mobs; bosses are a better source."
		""
		"With no &cWorld Tier&r progression, there are no higher tiers to unlock for Gems or Sockets. Gems remain loot, and Socket availability depends on the item or a Sigil of Socketing."
	]
	quest.153144F8AB0A4349.quest_subtitle: "Find Gems and fit them into compatible equipment"
	quest.153144F8AB0A4349.title: "&6Gems and Sockets"
	quest.156DC76AB7CD1065.quest_subtitle: "A &6Shaft&r is another basic but important machinery part that is required to make anything move with rotation. You can also extend the shaft to make it longer and affect more than one contraption that requires rotation"
	quest.156DC76AB7CD1065.title: "Rod of Constant Rotation"
	quest.15B40702B126BC7E.quest_desc: [
		"Place the &l【Charybdis Core】&r in a monster spawning area, then kill monsters to feed it EP."
		"You can use a Skill to check its EP or dig down to inspect it. When it reaches 100,000 EP, it will glow and make strange noises."
		"Right-click the core to hatch &l【Charybdis】&r."
	]
	quest.15B40702B126BC7E.quest_subtitle: "Ready to Hatch?"
	quest.15B40702B126BC7E.title: "Find and Defeat Charybdis, the Great Storm Demon"
	quest.15B51FB56A64C303.quest_desc: [
		"Many new buildings and upgrades are locked behind university research so it is worth getting a university built as soon as possible. Researcher will research various upgrades to your colony, and each level unlocks an additional researcher for a total of 5 researchers. Each Researcher can start their own research, but more Researchers does not lower the amount of time each individual research takes."
		""
		"Note: Research time is real-world time spent in-game. However, after level 3, Researchers will sometimes use offline time to work on researches."
	]
	quest.15B51FB56A64C303.quest_subtitle: "Build a University"
	quest.15F03A5E7E14C022.quest_desc: ["The stonemason is another key profession in the colony. They craft items commonly required by the builder. The stonemason will craft 3x3 recipes made entirely out of cobblestone, stone, andesite, diorite, granite, quartz, purpur, nether bricks, prismarine, sandstones, blackstone, and basalt. They can also craft end stone from cobblestone and an ender pearl after you complete the research."]
	quest.15F03A5E7E14C022.quest_subtitle: "Build a Stonemason's Hut"
	quest.1600000000000001.quest_desc: [
		"1. Possess a Werewolf to become a Tengu"
		"2. Use Secret Essence to become a Phantom"
		"3. Use Demon Essence to become a Fallen Angel"
		"4. Follow the normal Angel evolution path"
	]
	quest.1600000000000001.quest_subtitle: "Path of Evolution"
	quest.1600000000000006.quest_subtitle: "Use Demon Essence"
	quest.1600000000000010.quest_subtitle: "Use Secret Essence or Choose Reincarnation"
	quest.1600000000000015.quest_subtitle: "Possess a Werewolf"
	quest.160E4D26B4D8A901.title: "Materials for &3Crates"
	quest.166F39FFE1C98A63.quest_desc: [
		"&6Complete the \"Reset Counter\" quest to unlock this feature!&r"
		""
		"Lock a Skill to keep it when your character is reset. To unlock a Skill (so it will not be retained at your next reset), you must spend Soul Level and EP."
		""
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/lock.png width:100 height:122 align:center}"
		""
		"The number of available lock slots depends on your Soul Points. You gain one additional slot for every 20 Soul Points."
		""
		"&6Related quests:&r"
		"[ { \"text\": \"Reincarnation Essence and Reset Counter guide\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2E0D203C4166C35C\" } } ]"
		"[ { \"text\": \"Reset Counter quest\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"6533548BC66DB5E7\" } } ]"
	]
	quest.166F39FFE1C98A63.quest_subtitle: "What is the purpose of locking the Skill page?"
	quest.166F39FFE1C98A63.title: "Locking Skills"
	quest.16768703F653F67D.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.16AD4EB617DE27AE.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.16CC8DC5DEBB59BD.quest_desc: [
		"Possess a weakened physical body to enter a whole new world"
		"How to Use"
		"&lActive Skill&r If used while possessing a body, the user leaves that body behind along with its intrinsic skills and enters Spiritual Form. Unless it is the original body, the abandoned body disappears after 5 minutes to prevent lag. While in Spiritual Form, the user can possess targets that meet the following requirements: [Does not work on targets with Spiritual Attack Nullification enabled]"
		""
		"&l- Non-player monsters: &r"
		"Health below 10%, Spiritual Health below 10%, or maximum EP below 25% of the user's maximum EP. If the target has Spiritual Attack Resistance enabled, the requirements are reduced to 5% Health, 5% Spiritual Health, or 12.5% maximum EP."
		""
		"&l- Players:&r Must meet 2 of the 3 optional requirements above. If possessed, the target player enters Spiritual Form and will eventually die without the [Possession] skill."
		"When possessing a target, the user returns to Physical Form with the target's physical attributes and skills."
		""
		"&lWarning: When using this skill, held items and armor remain on the old body.&r"
		""
		"&lFriendly Reminder:&r Open the old body's inventory to retrieve those items."
		"When changing bodies through [Possession], only status effects with the \"spiritual affected\" tag are transferred; other normal status effects do not move with the soul."
	]
	quest.16CC8DC5DEBB59BD.quest_subtitle: "Your Innate Skill"
	quest.16CC8DC5DEBB59BD.title: "Possession"
	quest.16E0F71FC9927156.quest_desc: ["A cannon in the left hand and a chainsaw in the right hand. The eyes can also shoot lasers."]
	quest.16E0F71FC9927156.quest_subtitle: "They're not rusty."
	quest.16E0F71FC9927156.title: "Underground Guardian"
	quest.17087AB25D9B0F39.quest_subtitle: "&2Uncommon"
	quest.17087AB25D9B0F39.title: "Catch Guppy"
	quest.177AA072321C8090.quest_desc: [
		"&aConstellation&f papers turn up in old loot, in strongholds, temples, shipwrecks, buried treasure and some other ruins around the world."
		""
		"When you pick one up, a drawing appears of a &bConstellation&f you haven't seen yet. Right-click it to study the pattern and the moon phases it shows up in."
		""
		"You'll want to make a note of those phases somewhere for future use, though you'll be able to see them in the night sky."
	]
	quest.177AA072321C8090.title: "&aConstellation Paper"
	quest.178630352DAC45B8.quest_desc: ["&8A very common creature found in plains or ant holes"]
	quest.178630352DAC45B8.quest_subtitle: "Several times bigger than a human."
	quest.178630352DAC45B8.title: "How Can Ants Get This Big?"
	quest.17AF79682E7BE5D3.quest_desc: ["The Mana Prism splits incoming mana bursts into multiple beams, allowing mana to be routed to more than one target."]
	quest.17AF79682E7BE5D3.quest_subtitle: "Splits mana bursts into multiple beams"
	quest.17AF79682E7BE5D3.title: "Mana Prism"
	quest.17D5656DDF929E02.quest_desc: [
		"Master [Gluttony] and [Merciless]. The player's race must be Hero's Egg / True Hero or Demon Lord's Egg / True Demon Lord."
		""
		"In multiplayer, only one player may own this skill. To remove this restriction, use /gamerule beelzebubTrulyUnique false"
	]
	quest.17D5656DDF929E02.quest_subtitle: "Requirements ↓"
	quest.17D5656DDF929E02.title: "&6[Advanced]&f Ultimate Skill Beelzebub"
	quest.17DE36653F7D75B7.quest_desc: ["The Fruit of Grisaia is a food source that does not run out."]
	quest.17DE36653F7D75B7.title: "Fruit of Grisaia"
	quest.17E6DCDBEEBAEEAD.title: "&aMinecart"
	quest.17EF7E10E3637513.quest_desc: ["Mana Pylons can provide the bookshelves required by an Enchanting Table. Place two nearby to support its enchantments."]
	quest.17EF7E10E3637513.title: "Mana Pylon"
	quest.182068714BF79ADB.quest_subtitle: "Choose one of the two and Wind Domination."
	quest.182068714BF79ADB.title: "&6[Advanced]&f Obtain Wind Manipulation and Master It"
	quest.1828789F09A9F162.title: "{translate:\"task.F6A7B8C9D0E12355.title\"}"
	quest.1852DD7EEF1CDBBB.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.187252C941FBC59B.quest_desc: [
		"Craft Brilliant Fiber, then right-click leaves with it. Wait about one in-game day for them to become Golden Leaves, then harvest them to obtain Gold Leaf."
		""
		"&6It is recommended to collect at least 20 Gold Leaves first, as rituals, altars, and tokens will require many of them later.&r"
	]
	quest.187252C941FBC59B.quest_subtitle: "Getting Started"
	quest.187252C941FBC59B.title: "The Age of Aura Revival"
	quest.188FFA5DA16BAA36.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.18B0E4E9EBA923B2.title: "{translate:\"task.CC3D4E5F6A7B8902.title\"}"
	quest.18C9E163F746C545.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Alfheim Portal to trade mana and materials for elven goods. Keep the portal supplied: both Mana Pools must hold substantial mana for it to activate."
		""
		"The construction materials can be sourced from a single Terrasteel Ingot. This objective tracks Glimmering Livingwood Logs and Livingwood Logs as its material examples."
	]
	quest.18C9E163F746C545.title: "The Elven Portal"
	quest.18D02B9CA2B7471F.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.18E0C29D20AC8977.quest_subtitle: "&bDemanding Dish"
	quest.18F99ED28A090AAF.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.19098B587950C0D2.quest_desc: [
		"Your mount will have a speed bonus"
		"&6&lGalloping [Unlocking the illustrated book]"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/cowboy_hat.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
	]
	quest.19098B587950C0D2.quest_subtitle: "Ride Like a Cowboy"
	quest.190D1347F76969DD.quest_subtitle: "A Structure on an Outer Island of the End"
	quest.190D1347F76969DD.title: "Looking For a \"Harsh\" Arena"
	quest.190FD2DF12D222C0.title: "&dBar of Ruby Chocolate"
	quest.191AA02FB477C725.quest_desc: ["You can only obtain this material from a dragon that has not yet been reduced to a skeleton."]
	quest.191AA02FB477C725.quest_subtitle: "Obtained from the dead dragon."
	quest.191AA02FB477C725.title: "Get Dragon Blood"
	quest.19269D0C42C44F99.quest_desc: ["Use the Mechanical Eye to locate this ancient underground structure."]
	quest.19269D0C42C44F99.quest_subtitle: "Which creator’s strength is it?"
	quest.19269D0C42C44F99.title: "Go to Ancient Factory"
	quest.193E5B95AEC2897A.quest_desc: [
		"The corresponding structure can be found in the wild. The one with a beacon-like beam of light is the portal structure."
		"Right-click the portal entity to enter the boss room."
	]
	quest.193E5B95AEC2897A.quest_subtitle: "Ancient Technology That Can Lead to the Mysterious Realm"
	quest.195092488B2C9636.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.19A802860BE1693E.quest_desc: [
		"&eAstral Sorcery&f is an art devised by human star-wizards of the &bCardinal World&f. By gathering &bmagicules&f beneath the night sky and aligning them with the &bConstellations&f, its practitioners refine their craft and deepen their connection to &6Veldanava&f, the &6Star-King Dragon&f."
		""
		"To get started, you'll need &aAquamarine Shale&f, found in riverbeds and shallow shores within the sand. It breaks with a stone shovel or better, and the &2Aquamarine&f inside will be used during early progression."
	]
	quest.19A802860BE1693E.quest_subtitle: "Unlocks the Tome and Constellation Paper"
	quest.19A802860BE1693E.title: "Welcome to &eAstral Sorcery"
	quest.19C04F9C32B84448.quest_desc: ["The Ring of Loki lets the wearer place several blocks at once, making large builds easier to assemble."]
	quest.19C04F9C32B84448.title: "Ring of Loki"
	quest.19C5853C695A22A7.quest_subtitle: "A &6Wrench&r lets you instantly break most &6&lCreate&r blocks by &eShift + Right-clicking&r. And rotate them by &eRight-clicking&r. Your all-purpose friend you'll never leave home without again"
	quest.19C5853C695A22A7.title: "Create Wrench"
	quest.19D03831EB5EED02.quest_desc: ["The Blacksmith is a 3x3 crafter and can make any vanilla tools, armor, swords, and shields (no bows or redstone items). You will need to teach the Blacksmith the recipes of the items you want them to create. "]
	quest.19D03831EB5EED02.quest_subtitle: "Build a Blacksmith Hut"
	quest.19F38BBF546A9466.quest_desc: "Has a chance to be obtained by defeating Water Spirits, or by mining in the Ice Spikes biome"
	quest.19F38BBF546A9466.quest_subtitle: "How to Obtain"
	quest.1A1E16EDB23AD4F7.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.1A2B3C4D5E6F7890.title: "{translate:\"task.1A2B3C4D5E6F7891.title\"}"
	quest.1A389BBE7CDB0F96.quest_subtitle: "A &6Hose Pulley&r can be used to place or extract large bodies of liquid"
	quest.1A389BBE7CDB0F96.title: "Obtain Hose Pulley"
	quest.1A39147D2FC7AF3C.quest_subtitle: "Steam it up."
	quest.1A3D3F6F1ADAAE46.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.1A3F6434B2919A16.quest_desc: ["&6There is a 1% chance to drop it when a creature under the Berserk effect is killed. &rConsuming 10 unlocks the ability to lock Wrath King in the “Lock” screen."]
	quest.1A9A3CD4F01D709A.quest_desc: [
		"Plant Mystical Petals and apply Bone Meal to grow a tall flower. Harvesting it yields several petals."
		""
		"This objective tracks a White Double Mystical Flower."
	]
	quest.1A9A3CD4F01D709A.title: "Growing Tall Mystical Flowers"
	quest.1AA35C0479B67340.quest_subtitle: "A Better Way to Evolve"
	quest.1AC815D3CDFC6F62.quest_subtitle: "&dCulinary Ordeal"
	quest.1ADD951F05FFD421.quest_subtitle: "Defeat directly!"
	quest.1ADD951F05FFD421.title: "Kill the Sculptor - Master of the Arm"
	quest.1AEA264A1802A7FE.quest_desc: [
		"Every region of the Central Axis World has its own climate, mana, and dangers. A Nature's Compass helps you seek a biome before setting out, making it easier to chart unfamiliar lands and prepare for the creatures and resources you may find there."
		""
		"Craft the compass to complete this botanical study."
		""
		"&6&lRecipe note:&r This pack changes the default recipe. It requires four Botania Mystical Flowers (one in each corner), four Livingwood Logs (one in each cardinal direction), and a Compass in the center."
	]
	quest.1AEA264A1802A7FE.title: "Nature's Compass"
	quest.1AECBCFE5C2CD2C7.quest_desc: [
		"Evolve using the “Integration” mode of Raphael, Lord of Wisdom, while meeting all of the following requirements:"
		"- Become a True Demon Lord."
		"- Master Raphael, Lord of Wisdom."
		"- Master Uriel, Lord of Vows."
		"- Master Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony."
		"- Have at least 20 mastered skills."
		"- Reach a maximum EP of 2,000,000. EP will not be consumed."
		"- Have at least 1,000,000 Magicules. 1,000,000 Magicules will be consumed after a successful evolution."
		""
		"Only one player may possess this skill in multiplayer. To remove this restriction, use /gamerule shubNiggurathTrulyUnique false"
	]
	quest.1AECBCFE5C2CD2C7.quest_subtitle: "Requirements ↓"
	quest.1AECBCFE5C2CD2C7.title: "&6【Advanced】&f Ultimate Skill: Shub-Niggurath, Lord of Harvest"
	quest.1AF9B2AEF4CA630F.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Abyss Offering to right-click the Abyss Altar in the center to summon it."
		"&6It has two stages and has Skills: water attribute attack invalidation, cold invalidation, physical attack resistance, thrust resistance, poison resistance, electric shock resistance and heat wave resistance."
	]
	quest.1AF9B2AEF4CA630F.quest_subtitle: "Behemoth of the Deep"
	quest.1AF9B2AEF4CA630F.title: "Crusade Against Leviathan"
	quest.1AFEF2789E7179B1.quest_subtitle: "A &6Stressometer&r lets you see the current stress and stress capacity of the kinetic network it's connected to"
	quest.1AFEF2789E7179B1.title: "Obtain Stressometer"
	quest.1B277EAB185E607D.title: "Lesser Poison Taratect"
	quest.1B3F3097CE12FE41.quest_subtitle: "The thing your trains go on"
	quest.1B3F3097CE12FE41.title: "Train Track"
	quest.1B4EA9D4B62D0237.quest_subtitle: "A &cRedstone Contact&r component that outputs a signal when in contact with another &cRedstone Contact&r. Particularly useful for building contraptions"
	quest.1B4EA9D4B62D0237.title: "Obtain Redstone Contact"
	quest.1B715F3A51FC08CA.quest_subtitle: "[Choose a route; you can also challenge them all alone.]"
	quest.1B757ABD61B27F77.quest_subtitle: "&7Common"
	quest.1B757ABD61B27F77.title: "Catch Cave Crawler"
	quest.1BA1D9A0C6A07A87.quest_desc: [
		"A vast, naturally lit cave system. This is a massive underground biome containing the ruins of an entire dwarven city. It is a high-risk, high-reward environment where players can find the largest number of mechanical creatures and the most valuable treasures."
		""
		"How do you find it?"
		"You can find a map to it in chests inside abandoned mechanical dwarf ruins on the surface"
	]
	quest.1BA1D9A0C6A07A87.quest_subtitle: "Ruins of a Dwarven City"
	quest.1BB3578F45B78F38.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click the &aLightwell&f with &3Crystal&f or an &2Aquamarine&f to set it in the basin and slowly collect &bLiquid Starlight&f inside it, consuming the material in the process."
		""
		"You can pull out &bLiquid Starlight&f with a bucket, or pipe it from underneath the &aLightwell&f, then drop items into &bLiquid Starlight&f in-world to transform them."
		""
		"By draining the pool they are thrown into, &3Crystals&f grow a size step and two crystals can merge into one, with the bigger &3Crystal&f keeping some of what the smaller one had while losing something during the merge."
		""
		"&bLiquid Starlight&f can also be used to make a packed ice generator when placed next to water, and a sand generator next to lava, which can then become &2Aquamarine Shale&f."
	]
	quest.1BB3578F45B78F38.title: "&aLightwell"
	quest.1BB571557F74D3A1.quest_desc: ["As you have explored, you may have encountered abandoned colonies. If you like, you can take over an abandoned colony and repair it. This can be a good way to jumpstart your colony. However, if you want the full colony experience, then it’s recommended that you find a good place to settle your colony and start the old fashioned way. Blood, sweat and tears. "]
	quest.1BB571557F74D3A1.title: "Abandoned Villages"
	quest.1BC46234E9DAD141.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.1BDCD39F37B26598.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.1C16AEE8E29FB5A0.quest_desc: [
		"The rallying banner will summon your Guards to you when used. It’s especially useful in raids, as Guards don’t automatically know where to find the raiders. You must shift + right-click the banner on a Guard tower or Barracks Tower to assigns the Guards in that tower to the rallying banner."
		""
		"Note: Your Guards will not follow you outside the colony border. To bring Guards outside the border, set them to Follow you on the second page of their tower GUI."
	]
	quest.1C2128869B7673D7.quest_subtitle: "How can you cook without a stove?"
	quest.1C367AE15A6C4B76.quest_desc: [
		"Grimoires are dropped from various wizard tower chests:"
		""
		"Ruined Wizard Tower"
		"Rotted Wizard Tower"
		"Frozen Wizard Tower"
		"Buried Wizard Tower"
		"Burnt Wizard Tower"
	]
	quest.1C709492F2F78BB9.quest_subtitle: "Attach to any inventory to expand its surface area. Great for access in tight spaces and smart setups with threshold switches. - Provides an interface to access two inventories simultaneously. Also comes with filter slots to quickly sort incoming items"
	quest.1C709492F2F78BB9.title: "&aInventory Access Port"
	quest.1C74FBA64D8DB9AB.title: "Ogre King"
	quest.1CB9ABD69E49CD85.quest_subtitle: "&dCulinary Ordeal"
	quest.1CC54A8CED83647C.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.1CCEC8864C668C2D.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.1CD3F15F43DC7C8F.quest_desc: [
		"To name a creature, reduce its HP below 25% of its maximum or inflict Fear on it. The namer must trigger the Fear effect."
		""
		"&d[Tame] (-):&r Uses only enough mana to tame the target; MP is not permanently consumed."
		""
		"&d[Evolution] (=):&r If applicable, causes the target NPC to evolve."
		""
		"&d[Gift] (+):&r If applicable, causes the target NPC to evolve and multiplies its EP by 10. There is a 10% chance the naming cost will be permanently consumed, up to 300% of the normal cost."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lQ: How to make monsters fearful?&r"
		"&lAnswer:&r Use Coercion, Domineering, or a similar Skill to inflict Fear. Once the quick-naming requirements are met, name the creature."
		"When mastering skills such as Coercion and Domineering, adjust their power with Shift + Skill Key + mouse. Lower power deals less damage."
	]
	quest.1CD3F15F43DC7C8F.quest_subtitle: "How to name it?"
	quest.1CF63C044EAFA8D7.quest_subtitle: "Creatures from the Dark Forest and Pale Forest"
	quest.1CF63C044EAFA8D7.title: "The Flying Giant Moth"
	quest.1D0911E494CA0184.quest_subtitle: "A &6Mechanical Arm&r is an advanced item distribution machine that works by designating it to specific blocks the arm can reach. If it can't reach a location, the arm won't work. Requires &6SUs&r to operate"
	quest.1D0911E494CA0184.title: "Obtain Mechanical Arm"
	quest.1D217C6641299B70.quest_subtitle: "Can be found in the Dwarf Royal Tower."
	quest.1D217C6641299B70.title: "Dwarven Kingdom Flag"
	quest.1D261057E7B4E07A.quest_desc: ["Use the Wand of the Forest to bind flowers and devices, inspect mana flow, and adjust connections. Its crafted petals also determine the wand's color."]
	quest.1D261057E7B4E07A.title: "Wand of the Forest"
	quest.1D546242FFFD9DB3.quest_subtitle: "&2Uncommon"
	quest.1D546242FFFD9DB3.title: "Catch Blue Neonfish"
	quest.1D68B74BF2CBB0DC.quest_desc: ["A Mana Tablet stores mana for transport between pools. While charged and carried, it can also supply mana to compatible trinkets; use the Wand of the Forest to switch its pool mode."]
	quest.1D68B74BF2CBB0DC.title: "Mana Tablet"
	quest.1D870390E22D0E28.quest_subtitle: "I want some soup."
	quest.1D98174DC7159C28.quest_subtitle: "A &cPowered Toggle Latch&r toggles its state with every redstone pulse"
	quest.1D98174DC7159C28.title: "Obtain Powered Toggle Latch"
	quest.1DAB0F69BE29D8C5.quest_desc: ["Can also be used to create infinite &9water&r by extracting from a source block that has 2 source blocks adjacent to it"]
	quest.1DAB0F69BE29D8C5.quest_subtitle: "Since most blocks in &6&lCreate&r don't allow for manual extraction and insertion of liquids, these &6Fluid Pipes&r are rather useful"
	quest.1DAB0F69BE29D8C5.title: "Fluid Pipes"
	quest.1DE8784B7276EDA8.title: "&6【Side Quest】&r Even Stronger!"
	quest.1DF55B2C88B9B888.quest_desc: [
		"Ability to drink potions faster"
		"&6&lDrink quickly【Unlock the picture book】"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/plastic_drinking_hat.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
	]
	quest.1DF55B2C88B9B888.quest_subtitle: "Chug Potions Faster"
	quest.1E1870FAD295DEDE.quest_desc: [
		"Clear and flatten an area about 20×20 blocks to make space for your camp. The camp cannot be placed if objects block the area. Right-click the supply camp on the ground to see a 3D preview. Use the arrow controls to position the camp within your cleared space, then click the green checkmark to place it. "
		""
		"If placement fails, the terrain is still in the way, remove obstacles until it fits. Red lines will mark spots that need further clearing."
	]
	quest.1E2728F6C84FFB35.quest_desc: ["This stone generates on the surface near hot springs."]
	quest.1E2728F6C84FFB35.quest_subtitle: "A Scorching-Hot Mine"
	quest.1E2728F6C84FFB35.title: "Ore near the Hot Spring"
	quest.1E3081292571CD31.title: "&cSoothing Hot Chocolate"
	quest.1E58DB775CD0CE1E.quest_subtitle: "【Mastery】"
	quest.1E58DB775CD0CE1E.title: "&6【Advanced】&f Obtain the Unique Skill Adaptability"
	quest.1E6A8B0B25062315.quest_desc: [
		"You'll need a crafting table that can attune to the starlight of &bConstellations&f. Throw a Crafting Table and 4 &2Marble&f into a &3Focal Point&f to make an &aIlluminated Crafting Table&f."
		""
		"A new tier of your &bTome&f opens up when you pick up the &aIlluminated Crafting Table&f. It needs no structure yet, only a clear view of the sky."
		""
		"To craft with it, lay out the ingredients at night and Right-click it with the &aResonating Wand&f."
	]
	quest.1E6A8B0B25062315.quest_subtitle: "Unlocks the Lightwell, Starmetal and Sooty Marble"
	quest.1E6A8B0B25062315.title: "&aIlluminated Crafting Table"
	quest.1E6B0E1E6B5998C7.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.1E7A25799F815ABA.quest_desc: [
		"When a Dwarf takes the Lumberjack profession, it cuts down trees and replants them. Afterward, it stores the wood in the nearest chest."
		"Build an enclosed tree farm and place several Lumberjack workstations with chests to create an automatic logging farm."
		""
		"&6Note: The npcWorking gamerule is disabled by default. Enable it with /gamerule npcWorking true."
		"&4Too many Dwarves with this rule enabled can reduce TPS to 10!"
	]
	quest.1E7A25799F815ABA.quest_subtitle: "Fully Automatic Lumberyard"
	quest.1E7A25799F815ABA.title: "How Could You Steal Wood from a Lumberjack!"
	quest.1E93BAC7C83AAAFB.quest_subtitle: "&6Ultima's Table"
	quest.1E9525E2FC9F773B.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.1EB44121D6968D59.title: "Obtain Wheat Flour"
	quest.1EC1DB83108201AE.quest_desc: [
		"&aRock Crystal&f grows among the stone at the bottom of the world. A &aResonating Wand&f will highlight the &2Crystal Ore&f through the ground as you approach it."
		""
		"It requires at least an iron-tier pickaxe to break."
		""
		"Every &aRock Crystal&f rolls its own size and quality, and the better the crystal, the better the results of whatever you use it for."
	]
	quest.1EC1DB83108201AE.title: "&aRock Crystal"
	quest.1EDD37632534A093.title: "Arachne"
	quest.1EE4A5C43CE2B840.title: "&lEmpty Fan Catalyst"
	quest.1EEA7724FA3BB72C.quest_desc: [
		"Killing creatures will give you more loot."
		"&6&lGenerous gains【Unlock illustrated book】"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/superstitious_hat.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
	]
	quest.1EEA7724FA3BB72C.quest_subtitle: "Loot More"
	quest.1F4456568BDB3EAD.quest_subtitle: "A &6Contraption Control&r let you turn off parts of contraptions while they are formed"
	quest.1F4456568BDB3EAD.title: "Obtain Contraption Controls"
	quest.1F6166FE5D1FA206.quest_subtitle: "Castle Destroyed by Evil Spirits"
	quest.1F894D1554FABD87.quest_desc: [
		"Reach the ocean floor faster?"
		"&6&lAnchored Descent [Unlock Codex]"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/charm_of_sinking.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
		""
		"Stand still to recover oxygen"
		"&6&lDeep Diver [Unlock Codex]"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/charm_of_sinking_2.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
	]
	quest.1F894D1554FABD87.quest_subtitle: "Underwater Parkour"
	quest.1FA401913848D8B4.quest_desc: "&6Has an 80% chance to drop from Rimuru. &rIf you have Gluttonous King, consuming 10 of these lets you lock this Ultimate Skill on the \"Lock\" screen, preventing it from being lost through reincarnation."
	quest.1FC0D1E50C61E0BA.quest_desc: ["The Runic Altar crafts runes from infused materials and other ingredients. Read its entry in the Lexica Botania for the full process."]
	quest.1FC0D1E50C61E0BA.title: "Runic Altar"
	quest.2005FA370149167D.quest_subtitle: "An &6Item Drain&r allows for the extraction of liquids from items manually or automatically"
	quest.2005FA370149167D.title: "Obtain Item Drain"
	quest.201CB898A399F1D5.quest_desc: [
		"The Swineherd’s Hut is where the Swineherd will breed and butcher pigs for food. You will have to capture and bring in two pigs to the Swineherd’s Hut, as the Swineherd will not catch and bring in any pigs."
		""
		"The Swineherd will only keep two pigs alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten pigs in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.201CB898A399F1D5.quest_subtitle: "Build a Swineherd's Hut"
	quest.202D65775F9E31B8.quest_desc: ["Since some structures are currently missing from the mod, here is your first &eStarlight Focus Crystal&f. Use it wisely, there won't be another one."]
	quest.202D65775F9E31B8.quest_subtitle: "Alpha Mod"
	quest.202D65775F9E31B8.title: "Your First Crystal"
	quest.206159A3C7A78447.quest_desc: [
		"The Mystical Site is a simple building that increase a colony's overall happiness level. It has no worker and increases colonists' happiness just by existing."
		""
		"The Mystical Site also gives a bonus to the maximum resurrection chance of the Undertaker."
		""
		"Before you get too excited. No, there is no benefit or bonus from building multiple mystical sites. "
	]
	quest.206159A3C7A78447.quest_subtitle: "Build a Mystical Site"
	quest.206401394C062679.quest_desc: ["Use the Cursed Eye to locate this prison in the tundra."]
	quest.206401394C062679.quest_subtitle: "Siberian Prison"
	quest.206401394C062679.title: "Go to Bitter Cold Prison"
	quest.20649F463DE77186.quest_desc: [
		"Ignite your opponent"
		"&6&lFlame Guard [Unlock Codex]"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/flame_pendant.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
	]
	quest.20649F463DE77186.quest_subtitle: "Power of Flame"
	quest.207CE698F9A78BCE.quest_desc: "5% chance to be randomly obtained from chests."
	quest.207CE698F9A78BCE.quest_subtitle: "Slightly restore your magicules."
	quest.209E2AD1EE638BBE.quest_desc: [
		"Requirements:"
		"Be a True Demon Lord or a True Hero"
		"Have 3 million magicules. Obtaining this skill consumes 1 million maximum magicules."
		"Possess and master Sniper【Retained after evolution】"
	]
	quest.209E2AD1EE638BBE.quest_subtitle: "Requirements ↓"
	quest.209E2AD1EE638BBE.title: "&6【Advanced】&f Ultimate Skill: Hell Snipe"
	quest.20A1657615E20F11.quest_desc: [
		"On rare occassions, the Spirits of the Elemental Realm will take notice of a traveler, and bestow upon them a special gift: &eThe Ring of the Elves&f."
		""
		"It is the most sacred treasure allowed to be gifted to a non-spiritual creature, signifying an intense interest or curiosity of the individual who sought contracts of the Five Great Spirits. As such, in order to obtain this ring, one must successfully forge a contract with the Great Spirits of Earth, Fire, Wind, Water, and Space."
		""
		"Spiritual creatures who leave the Elemental Realm for the first time, meanwhile, will be gifted their own Ring of the Elves in their &5Ender Chest&f, in the hopes that one day, they too will discover a mortal worthy of receiving it as a gift."
	]
	quest.20A1657615E20F11.quest_subtitle: "How to Obtain"
	quest.20A55D75DBA16FFB.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.2163D4B45D32FDE9.quest_desc: ["The Dice of Fate are dropped by the second-tier Gaia Guardian. Each one grants a Relic of the Aesir when opened; the first six rewards are different."]
	quest.2163D4B45D32FDE9.title: "Dice of Fate"
	quest.218D55A1E23FB66A.quest_subtitle: "&9Rare"
	quest.218D55A1E23FB66A.title: "Catch Blossom Bass"
	quest.21B29DCE7B2F00E1.quest_desc: [
		"It has two stages and has a rage value. When the rage value is full, it will \"crazy\" and charge at you."
		"&6The Skills it possesses are: Cold Invalidation, Pain Invalidation, Holy Attack Resistance, Poison Invalidation, Abnormal Status Resistance and Psychic Attack Resistance"
	]
	quest.21B29DCE7B2F00E1.quest_subtitle: "Skeleton Dragon"
	quest.21B29DCE7B2F00E1.title: "Crusade Against Ancient Relics"
	quest.21CB5CD7B58ECCC4.quest_subtitle: "&9Rare"
	quest.21CB5CD7B58ECCC4.title: "Catch Gilded Minnow"
	quest.21D64A9C2520E210.quest_desc: [
		"[ { \"text\": \"Click to view the quests you need to complete [Ancient Forest]\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4835EBAC6D933CDB\" } } ]"
		""
		"&6&lInside the maze:&r"
		"After entering the maze, you are in a large corridor. Follow the corridor up to the battle platform of the \"Holy Spirit Guardian Colossus\"."
		"Once inside, you must defeat it or be defeated by it."
		"&8&lEnding - Death:&r"
		"-You won't actually die; you'll be teleported outside the barrier, near the exit."
		"-Elves can still be contracted."
		""
		"&6&lEnding - Victory:&r"
		"-When the Colossus dies, it drops a block of Pure Magicsteel."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Whether you defeat the Colossus or are defeated, you can continue up the stairs that turn right and climb to the upper platforms."
		"On the platforms, hold Shift to obtain the following tiers of spirits:"
		"Prayer has a 1,200-second (20-minute) cooldown."
		"&b1. Lower Elf (Level 1)&r"
		"-Low magic power."
		"-Grants the corresponding low-tier elemental magic and elemental control (must be learned)."
		"&22. Median Elf (Level 2)&r"
		"-Has greater magic power than a Lower Elf."
		"-Grants the corresponding mid-tier elemental magic and elemental control (must be learned)."
		"-Use [Medium Elf Summon] to materialize a spirit you own (requires switching)."
		"&53. Superior Elf (Level 3)&r"
		"-One of the strongest types of elf."
		"-Grants all corresponding elemental magic and elemental control (must be learned)."
		"-This type of spirit is required to awaken a \"Brave\". Collect all six types."
		"-Use [Higher Spirit Summoning] to materialize a spirit you own (requires switching)."
		"&44. Elf King (Level 4)&r"
		"-Currently the strongest type of elf."
		"-It grants no additional abilities, but it is exceptionally rare."
		""
		"instruction:"
		"To check your spirits, cooldowns, and other details, use the command:"
		"/tensura get spirit"
	]
	quest.21D64A9C2520E210.quest_subtitle: "The Dimension of the Elves"
	quest.21D64A9C2520E210.title: "&6【Main Story】&r Elf Maze Portal"
	quest.220D03EF87821AB8.title: "Materials for the &2Trading Depot"
