	quest.22C93D50E567E15A.title: "Small Taratect"
	quest.22D3778029D7B924.quest_subtitle: "&6Mechanical Belts&r are useful for moving items either in a straight line or diagonally. Make sure to place a &6Shaft&r on each end so they can connect and work properly"
	quest.22D3778029D7B924.title: "Mechanical Belt"
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.quest_desc: ["When placing any building, including your supply camp or ship. You will have the option to change your colony style. Click the “Switch Pack” button to open a menu with many styles to choose from. "]
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.title: "Colony Styles"
	quest.23012F6C4C522CEB.quest_desc: ["The Forester is an essential worker in your colony. They will chop down trees and replant a sapling in the tree’s place. Foresters will chop any tree in the immediate area. However, this area can be restricted using a &ezoning tool&r available in the hut block. "]
	quest.23012F6C4C522CEB.quest_subtitle: "Build the Forester's Hut"
	quest.230501AEC4ACF1A5.quest_desc: [
		"The &3Traversal Wand&f has two modes, switched with Sneak + Right-click."
		""
		"In the first, hold Right-click to charge and release to be launched in the direction you're looking, taking no fall damage on landing. In the second, it draws a line to where you're looking and pulls you straight there when you let go."
		""
		"The &3Impulsion Wand&f pulls you to the block it hooks onto, and hooking a mob pulls you to the mob."
	]
	quest.230501AEC4ACF1A5.title: "&3Traversal and Impulsion Wands"
