	quest.25014047C30407BA.quest_subtitle: "New to the modpack? This guide is for you."
	quest.2515FE33D75FECAB.quest_desc: "&6Has an 80% chance to drop from Hinata. &rIf you have Uriel, consuming 10 of these lets you lock this Ultimate Skill on the \"Lock\" screen, preventing it from being lost through reincarnation."
