	quest.289D978A3CB3FE69.quest_subtitle: "An &6Andesite Tunnel&r is used to manage the flow of items on belts by splitting or merging production lines"
	quest.289D978A3CB3FE69.title: "Obtain Andesite Tunnel"
	quest.28A5C8D0E3DBF050.quest_desc: [
		"Your first victory proved you could withstand the Gaia Guardian—but not that you had faced its full power. This second rite draws out the Guardian's true strength; now you must face the might it previously held back."
		""
		"&6&lPreparation:&r Treat this as a far more demanding rematch. Bring strong protection, a dependable source of healing, plenty of food, and mobility or resistance buffs. Keep your supplies and mana ready before beginning the rite."
		"&6&lIn the fight:&r Stay alert as the guardian changes position; do not chase blindly or linger in its purple attacks. Keep moving, recover between openings, and use deliberate strikes rather than trying to overwhelm it in one burst. Defeat this aspect to prove that your first victory was no chance encounter."
	]
	quest.28A5C8D0E3DBF050.title: "Defeat Gaia Guardian II"
	quest.28B912AFF70B40C7.quest_desc: ["You can get it from skeletal dragons in the wild, or from slain dragons."]
