	quest.2AE3E90D07A627F5.title: "Obtain Electric Motor"
	quest.2AFA42AFC1F22F78.quest_subtitle: "May be slightly weaker than biological magic steel."
	quest.2AFA42AFC1F22F78.title: "Charybdis suit"
	quest.2B209E525A3F5160.quest_desc: ["Place an Alchemy Catalyst beneath a Mana Pool to unlock additional mana-infusion recipes. These can produce useful materials and convert some items into others."]
	quest.2B209E525A3F5160.title: "Alchemy Catalyst"
	quest.2B3C4D5E6F7A8901.title: "{translate:\"task.2B3C4D5E6F7A8902.title\"}"
	quest.2B40902E17F81207.quest_desc: [
		"After entering the Foundation Building stage, the player will randomly obtain a spiritual root."
		"Different spiritual roots grant the corresponding attribute's lower elemental spirit and bring their own unique ability enhancements."
		""
		"&4Fire Root&r"
		"Grants the fire-type lower elemental spirit."
		"Effect:"
		"Improves control over heat during alchemy."
		"Being close to an alchemy furnace can further reduce the time needed for refining."
		""
		"&9Water Root&r"
		"Grants the water-type lower elemental spirit."
		"Effect:"
		"Provides continuous recovery ability."
		"Passively restores health and Magicule."
		""
		"&bWind Root&r"
		"Grants the wind-type lower elemental spirit."
		"Effect:"
		"Provides movement enhancement."
		"Directly increases player movement speed."
		""
		"&#93452AEarth Root&r"
		"Grants the earth-type lower elemental spirit."
		"Effect:"
		"Provides basic combat and resistance abilities corresponding to the earth spirit."
		""
		"&fVoid Root"
		"Grants the space-type lower elemental spirit."
		"Effect:"
		"Provides basic abilities such as spatial shifting and spatial resistance."
	]
	quest.2B51A873B4182555.quest_desc: [
		"&#FFED54Hyperlink:&r"
		"[ { \"text\": \"How Artifacts Work\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4DB740093C0BA804\" } } ]"
		""
		"Default Effects"
		"&5Effect 1: Rising Inferno"
		"While the wearer is in combat, Fire damage increases by 1% over time."
		"Rising Inferno gains one stack every 3 seconds, stacking up to 20% increased Fire damage."
		"&5Effect 2: Hell Flare Amplification"
		"Increases Limited Hell Flare damage by 50%."
		"&5Effect 3: Commander's Controlled Rage"
		"Unlocks when the wearer possesses the Unique Skill Commander."
		"Commander's Controlled Rage upgrades Inspire and reduces Magicule costs based on the wearer's current MP/Magicule."
		"The lower the wearer's current MP/Magicule, the stronger the Magicule cost reduction."
		""
		"Refinement Bonuses"
		"Rising Inferno Scaling"
		"Each refinement allocated to Rising Inferno reduces the time between Fire damage stacks by 0.25 seconds."
		"Maximum: Rising Inferno can receive up to 2 refinements, reducing the stack timer to 2.5 seconds."
		"Hell Flare Amplification Scaling"
		"Each refinement allocated to Hell Flare Amplification increases Limited Hell Flare damage by an additional 10%."
		"Maximum: At +3 refinement, Hell Flare Amplification can increase Limited Hell Flare damage by up to 80%."
		"Commander's Controlled Rage Scaling"
		"Each refinement allocated to Commander's Controlled Rage changes the missing Magicule threshold used for each Magicule cost reduction step by 5%."
	]
	quest.2B51A873B4182555.title: "&6【Artifact】&f Grade 1 Ancient Artifact"
	quest.2B52905277B5C172.quest_subtitle: "&7Common"
	quest.2B52905277B5C172.title: "Catch White Crappie"
	quest.2B5B4F80FF58C22F.quest_desc: ["If you feel that Gua Sha is scratching, combine it into one&4Hot spring stone sword&rBar!"]
	quest.2B5B4F80FF58C22F.title: "Giant Moonvine? Burn It Down!"
	quest.2B5F6A8FDF29A2F8.quest_subtitle: "The &6Schematicannon&r is a special type of machine used to build structures with the use of &6Schematics&r"
	quest.2B5F6A8FDF29A2F8.title: "Obtain Schematicannon"
	quest.2B64F0E323A0A8EA.quest_desc: [
		"&l[Active - Long Press]:&r While held, this Skill locks the player into a 360° perspective slightly farther away than the normal third-person view. While active, it grants +0.02 movement speed, +0.5 swimming speed, +0.1 attack speed, and +0.1 mining speed (Haste I). If you have Existence Perception, it increases that Skill by 1 level and adds 10 blocks to its detection radius."
		""
		"After mastery, the Skill can be toggled and grants a 10% chance to dodge. Using it with a long press doubles the movement-speed and Existence Perception radius bonuses. It consumes 10 Magicules every 20 ticks."
		""
		"&6Requires at least 5,000 EP."
	]
	quest.2B64F0E323A0A8EA.quest_subtitle: "If there is a frame, you won’t hit it?"
	quest.2B64F0E323A0A8EA.title: "&6【Helpful Tip】&r An Essential Early-Game Skill: [Sky Eye]"
	quest.2B76FCB1361847B4.quest_subtitle: "A &6Speedometer&r lets you see the rotational speed of a kinetic network"
	quest.2B76FCB1361847B4.title: "Obtain Speedometer"
	quest.2B84F260EDCE5F1D.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.2B8533422784771E.quest_desc: [
		"Gain basic immunity to poison or reduce its effects"
		"&6&lPoison Resistance [Unlock Codex]"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/antidote_vessel.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
	]
	quest.2B8533422784771E.quest_subtitle: "Antidote"
	quest.2BCD69386094AAA9.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.2BDB21D672BA3E22.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.2BFD651FDC6813DB.quest_subtitle: "&bDemanding Dish"
	quest.2C2C9E868AC963D5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/quest.png width:155 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"Completing the quests in this chapter grants Reincarnation Essence. This system is tied to reincarnation: you must meet the requirements to reincarnate successfully and obtain a new Unique Skill. &6Completing the required commissions and obtaining Reincarnation Essence are necessary for the Reset Counter quest.&r"
		""
		"Reincarnation increases your Soul Level, and racial reincarnation can increase it further. As your Soul Level rises, you become stronger and unlock additional bonuses. Current bonuses include:"
		"1. Less proficiency loss for locked Skills when you reset"
		"2. A higher chance for commissions to have greater rarity"
		"3. A chance to receive additional commissions"
	]
	quest.2C2C9E868AC963D5.quest_subtitle: "&6You need to understand this system."
	quest.2C64EBC9BD734F6C.quest_subtitle: "&bDemanding Dish"
	quest.2C746CE4537BB8EB.quest_desc: [
		"The Natural Altar collects Aura from an area of roughly 20 blocks and can store up to about 500,000 Aura."
		"Main infusion recipes:"
		"Iron Ingot → Infused Iron Ingot"
		"Stone → Infused Rock"
		""
		"More recipes can be viewed in EMI (JEI)."
	]
	quest.2C746CE4537BB8EB.quest_subtitle: "Absorb Natural Aura"
	quest.2C7B4EE0E160A970.title: "&6Powered Rail"
	quest.2C82ADBF2E95C55D.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.2C9CB9C6B6350DF8.quest_desc: ["Most Botania devices run on mana. A Mana Spreader sends it in bursts from a source to a target; aim it carefully to keep your machines supplied."]
	quest.2C9CB9C6B6350DF8.title: "Mana Spreader"
	quest.2D020F4C90F8A506.quest_desc: ["Mana String is used in recipes for cobwebs and several useful trinkets. Keep some on hand as your workshop expands."]
	quest.2D020F4C90F8A506.title: "Mana String"
	quest.2D0F4B50B4D29B55.quest_subtitle: "A &cPulse Repeater&r sends a single pulse from a continuous redstone signal after a configurable amount of time"
	quest.2D0F4B50B4D29B55.title: "Obtain Pulse Repeater"
	quest.2D67CE51F7110224.quest_desc: "Right-click to place it on the ground. It will then absorb nearby Aura and convert it into various ores. This requires a large amount of Aura."
	quest.2D67CE51F7110224.quest_subtitle: "Convert nearby stone into various ores."
	quest.2D6CCA806E1A76CD.quest_subtitle: "A &cPulse Extender&r extends a pulse to a configurable duration"
	quest.2D6CCA806E1A76CD.title: "Obtain Pulse Extender"
	quest.2DA0976EFC249F4A.title: "Defeat the Night Lich"
	quest.2DB4047F56352F3B.quest_subtitle: "It's time for you to become a Demon Lord."
	quest.2DB4047F56352F3B.title: "&6【Main Story】&r EP Reaches 200,000"
	quest.2DE2EA8E74C55722.quest_desc: [
		"To become a &6&lHero Egg&r, you must undergo the World's special trial. &eBlessed &findividuals will find this trial less taxing, though becoming Blessed occurs naturally only 5% of the time. A Unique Skill such as &6Chosen One &fprovides the Blessed state naturally."
		""
		"If you are a non-spiritual being, you must contract with all 5 Greater Spirits: &4Ifrit&r, &1Undine&r, &3War Gnome&r, and &2Sylphide&r. Once these prerequisites have been met, so long as the player is not a Majin, they will become a Hero Egg."
		""
		"If you are a spiritual race, you must have the &6Holy &falignment, at least &e600000 EP&f, and have Named each of the 5 Greater Spirits at least once. Once all of these prerequisites have been met, traveling to the Altar in the Labyrinth will have the spiritual being become a Hero Egg."
	]
	quest.2DE2EA8E74C55722.quest_subtitle: "Submit after obtaining the Hero's Egg."
	quest.2DE2EA8E74C55722.title: "&6【Brave Line】&r Obtain the Hero's Egg"
	quest.2E0D203C4166C35C.quest_desc: [
		"Reincarnation Essence is a resource required to qualify for reincarnation. It is consumed when reincarnation is completed, and the amount required increases with each reincarnation."
		""
		"&cThe Reset Counter allows players to obtain more Unique Skills and lock more Unique Skills.&r"
		""
		"Once you meet the Reset Counter requirements, use a Character Reset Scroll to advance it."
		""
		"&6Related quests:&r"
		"[ { \"text\": \"Reset Counter quest\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"6533548BC66DB5E7\" } } ]"
		"[ { \"text\": \"Honorary Commissions and Soul Level\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2C2C9E868AC963D5\" } } ]"
	]
	quest.2E0D203C4166C35C.quest_subtitle: "Can only be obtained by completing honorary commissions."
	quest.2E0D203C4166C35C.title: "Reincarnation Essence"
	quest.2E31F85F781C4BCC.quest_desc: [
		"This amazing tool lets you &ahook yourself to a block and swing from it&r gaining momentum along the way and letting you launch yourself and get enough distance to hook yourself &ato the next block&r"
		""
		"You can even enchant it with the &dImpact enchantment&r to deal damage to whoever dares to get in your way"
		""
		"&o&8You can pair these with the&r &aSlime Boots&r &o&8and go even faster"
	]
