		"&6wand blueprint"
		"(10 gold coins) Exchanged at the Dwarf Magician (Master Level)"
	]
	quest.3AE1C3290500638F.quest_subtitle: "Reach 10 Citizens"
	quest.3B18EF0F9807CADB.quest_desc: ["The Rod of the Shaded Mesa can pick up and move entities. Use it to reposition creatures or other movable entities."]
	quest.3B18EF0F9807CADB.quest_subtitle: "Picks up and moves entities"
	quest.3B18EF0F9807CADB.title: "Rod of the Shaded Mesa"
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.quest_desc: [
		"Got your eye on a new recruit and need some hay bales? If you place a postbox outside your tavern you can request items from the warehouse and a courier will deliver them to the postbox."
		""
		"Similarly, if you have items you want taken to the warehouse, place them in a Stash and a courier will be along shortly to pick them up."
	]
	quest.3B5B1BFC34011F6C.quest_desc: [
		"&4Broken fragments of forgotten memories&r drift through your mind: a strange continent, floating in the void between&5Nebula and Chaos&r..."
		"&8You don't belong here, but fate has bound you to this place.&r"
	]
	quest.3B5B1BFC34011F6C.quest_subtitle: "Where is this place?"
	quest.3B5B1BFC34011F6C.title: "Set Out"
	quest.3B60B1CC41276A5D.quest_subtitle: "A Little Weaker than Diamond Armor"
	quest.3B60B1CC41276A5D.title: "Monster Ant Suit"
	quest.3B64BED389B2CF9F.title: "Obtain Bar Of White Chocolate"
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_desc: [
		"Possibly one of the most dangerous jobs, especially early on. The Nether Miner travels to the Nether to mine resources. When the miner travels through the portal, there is a chance they may die. So choose your worker carefully."
		""
		"The portal in the Nether Mine will transport players to the Nether. However, the Nether Miner does not actually travel into the Nether, nor do they actually mine any blocks in the Nether."
	]
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_subtitle: "Build a Nether Mine"
	quest.3B9FAA9A2B1AE6A4.quest_desc: [
		"There is a 1% chance to obtain it from chests in the Ruined Mage Tower."
		"&6Consume 10 to unlock access to the Lord of Time skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3B9FAA9A2B1AE6A4.quest_subtitle: "Keep this skill active."
	quest.3C348A1F46E6EDD3.quest_desc: ["They sleep on the first and second floors of the fortress. After killing them, they will drop void cores, which can be used as weapons or fused with other equipment in the mechanical fusion anvil."]
	quest.3C348A1F46E6EDD3.quest_subtitle: "Fortress Keeper"
	quest.3C348A1F46E6EDD3.title: "Defeat the Ender Golem"
	quest.3C4D5E6F7A8B9012.title: "{translate:\"task.3C4D5E6F7A8B9013.title\"}"
	quest.3C5160A9C279B5A9.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain a Demon Lord Seed, you must have&6200,000 EP&r and be a&5Demon or Chaos&r."
		""
		"&lWhat you can do with a Demon Lord Seed:&r"
		"&6- You are qualified to awaken the Demon Lord.&r"
		"&6- You unlock the ability to collect souls.&r"
	]
	quest.3C5160A9C279B5A9.quest_subtitle: "Demon Lord Seed is the advanced state of the demon. The souls of living things are attracting you."
	quest.3C5160A9C279B5A9.title: "&6【Demon Lord Route】&r Obtain Demon Lord Seed"
	quest.3CC0627851B75A07.quest_subtitle: "&5Very Rare"
	quest.3CC0627851B75A07.title: "Catch Windbass"
	quest.3CC3A23ABC773273.quest_subtitle: "&bDemanding Dish"
	quest.3CE393B3589BFC58.quest_desc: [
		"Put a bucket of &bLiquid Starlight&f in the &aIlluminated Crafting Table's&f grid along with the marble and crystal it needs, then craft at night to upgrade it in place into the &3Resonating Crafting Table&f."
		""
		"It won't work until its structure is built: &2Sooty Marble&f underneath, Runed Marble around the edge, and a ring of eight &2Focus Relays&f. The floor sparkles when it's correct. The &bTome's&f structure page shows the full layout, and Right-clicking the table with the &aResonating Wand&f shows what's missing."
		""
		"Recipes can now use items thrown on the ground nearby and &bLiquid Starlight&f from &3Containment Chalices&f in range."
	]
	quest.3CE393B3589BFC58.quest_subtitle: "Unlocks the Starlight Infuser and Attunement Altar"
	quest.3CE393B3589BFC58.title: "&3Resonating Crafting Table"
	quest.3CFDCA2717FC524D.quest_desc: [
		"&aCrystal Tools&f can be upgraded at the &dLuminous Crafting Altar&f. Each one consumes the focus of a specific &bConstellation&f, and each &diridescent&f tool gains a new ability:"
		""
		"The pickaxe mines in a wide area, and Right-clicking it highlights nearby ores."
		""
		"The axe fells whole trees at once and the shovel mines a wide area and follows veins. Sneaking with the axe or shovel breaks a single block."
		""
		"The sword can be charged. A brief charge sends out a wave of force, and a full charge calls a &bCelestial Strike&f down on your target, with an effect based on your attunement. Both hit hardest under open sky, and all cooldowns are halved at night."
	]
	quest.3CFDCA2717FC524D.title: "&dIridescent Tools"
	quest.3D041D8923064C9A.quest_subtitle: "A &6Mechanical Piston&r allows for the linear movement of structures using rotational force"
	quest.3D041D8923064C9A.title: "Mechanical Piston"
	quest.3D21F4D9FD963A1C.quest_desc: ["The Ring of Far Reach extends the distance at which you can interact with blocks."]
	quest.3D21F4D9FD963A1C.quest_subtitle: "Extends your reach"
	quest.3D21F4D9FD963A1C.title: "Ring of Far Reach"
	quest.3D22913B4FB369F3.quest_subtitle: "Probability of Dropping"
	quest.3D3989E80BF08149.quest_subtitle: "An &6Elevator Pulley&r allows for the creation of elevators and adding floors using Redstone Contacts"
	quest.3D3989E80BF08149.title: "Obtain Elevator Pulley"
	quest.3D3F898FE129112A.quest_desc: [
		"This structure generates in the desert and can be found through the Desert Eye"
		"There are many traps inside, be careful"
	]
	quest.3D3F898FE129112A.quest_subtitle: "Did the Egyptian pharaoh love pets?"
	quest.3D3F898FE129112A.title: "Searching for the Cursed Pyramid"
	quest.3D65C935CDC38F88.quest_subtitle: "The &6Mechanical Press&r is used for processing items provided beneath it on a depot or belt, or in a basin to compact"
	quest.3D65C935CDC38F88.title: "Mechanical Press"
	quest.3D905AACA9BE52EC.quest_desc: "Build a 3×3 base of Pure Magic Blocks, place a Block of Mithril in the center, then right-click it to summon the boss. &6Warning! It must be summoned in the Paths dimension."
	quest.3D905AACA9BE52EC.quest_subtitle: "Do not attempt this challenge unless you have defeated the final boss of the main storyline."
	quest.3D905AACA9BE52EC.title: "Build the Platform to Summon Feldway"
	quest.3DAA0D096C085183.quest_subtitle: "Submit after obtaining the corresponding elf."
	quest.3DAA0D096C085183.title: "Earth Elf•Intermediate"
	quest.3DE59F19B491EDC7.quest_desc: [
		"Turn in 300 Gold Coins to receive one random Unique Skill Study Book. The exchange excludes Unique Skills you already own."
		""
		"&6If you study a Unique Skill, doing so will consume Soul Energy."
		"[ { \"text\": \"Soul Energy\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"0FDA8DE439A0FC25\" } } ]"
		""
		"&6If you use a Character Reset Scroll without locking your skills, those skills will disappear."
		"[ { \"text\": \"Lock Skills\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"166F39FFE1C98A63\" } } ]"
	]
	quest.3DE59F19B491EDC7.quest_subtitle: "Pay the cost, get a Skill."
	quest.3DE59F19B491EDC7.title: "&6【Gamble】&f Unique Skills"
	quest.3E11E4D98FDCB817.quest_desc: ["Bind a Force Relay to another block with the Wand of the Forest. When the relay is moved by a piston, the bound block moves with it."]
	quest.3E11E4D98FDCB817.title: "Force Relay"
	quest.3E388A13C2BD5A0B.title: "Obtain Marshmallow"
	quest.3E3F3E34C07A9BD2.quest_subtitle: "&5Very Rare"
	quest.3E3F3E34C07A9BD2.title: "Catch Blazefish"
	quest.3E40ABDC59D2AD19.quest_subtitle: "&7Common"
	quest.3E40ABDC59D2AD19.title: "Catch Tuna"
	quest.3E46E4EAE2B99FCD.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.3E68562B397B60E0.quest_subtitle: "A &6Deployer&r is a simple machine with massive potential. Acts as a psuedo-player, allowing you to right click with items you insert to use them, or left click to attack and mine with them"
	quest.3E68562B397B60E0.title: "Obtain Deployer"
	quest.3EB3943CC473BA9B.quest_subtitle: "&2Uncommon"
	quest.3EB3943CC473BA9B.title: "Catch Opah"
	quest.3EB8B9D18E59F0D6.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.3EBFD5237BAC875A.quest_subtitle: "Crafting Materials"
	quest.3ED0226315017D8D.quest_subtitle: "A &aSticker&r sticks to blocks when powered by &credstone&r. Great for mobile anchors on airships"
	quest.3ED0226315017D8D.title: "Obtain Sticker"
	quest.3EDF5BDA8A033513.quest_subtitle: "&dCulinary Ordeal"
	quest.3F03A4F9F769C8A4.quest_subtitle: "&7Common"
	quest.3F03A4F9F769C8A4.title: "Catch Tuna"
	quest.3F2CD9EDBCBFF597.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.3F4BD63F845CD390.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.3F5C0F8E1B705059.title: "&eCandy Cane Sword"
	quest.3F77375A5E0F0FFA.quest_desc: ["I do not know how this is obtained, but you got it. "]
	quest.3F850F759BC2874D.quest_desc: ["The Life Imbuer keeps spawners active without a nearby player. Craft one to add this spawner utility to your Botania toolkit."]
	quest.3F850F759BC2874D.quest_subtitle: "Keeps spawners active without a nearby player"
	quest.3F850F759BC2874D.title: "Life Imbuer"
	quest.3F882E756D81F85A.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.3F91078C3A37F487.quest_subtitle: "&bDemanding Dish"
	quest.3F92724DDA398BAB.quest_desc: [
		"&6You can't kill [Stern] directly; you have to trick the \"Judgment Bird\" into the immobilization trap during the round when [Crime of Murder] is pronounced, and then induce [Severe] to kill the bird with [Purification Laser], so that it can \"commit\" itself. Every time it \"commits\", the boss's health bar will be reduced by 1.&6It will die after 10 reductions."
		""
		""
		"Its real \"health bar\" is not its life, but how many times it can commit [crimes] severely. The initial value is 10. Every time it successfully commits a crime, its health bar is -1. When it commits ≥ 5 crimes in total, it enters the second stage."
		""
		"So this battle is not essentially an \"output war\", but:"
		"Design a game and let the boss break the rules himself."
		""
		"[Crime of Murder] is your output turn"
		"In this round, killing any entity will give the killer +1 [Crime]"
		"This is the only round that can make Yan Yan lose blood."
		"Because you can let it kill the Bird of Judgment"
		"Prioritize the bird of judgment, lead the bird to the immobilization trap, let the bird be tied up, and then wait/guide it strictly to fire the purification laser"
	]
	quest.3F92724DDA398BAB.title: "Defeat Stern"
	quest.3F98657DFD336347.quest_desc: [
		"The equipment you have worn since childhood has appeared!"
		"&3Lower level magic steel (18kEP)->&r"
		"&bSuperior Magic Steel (52kEP) ->&r"
		"&5Pure Magic Steel (225kEP)->&r"
		"&dBiological Magic Steel (750kEP)&r-> &4ultimate metal&r"
		""
		"Same as Monster Leather, both can evolve."
	]
	quest.3F98657DFD336347.quest_subtitle: "The Art of Healing and Forging"
	quest.3F98657DFD336347.title: "&6【Forging Line·Important】&r Wrap Yourself Right!"
	quest.3FA83CA20E40D5F0.title: "{translate:\"task.FF6A7B8C9D0E1235.title\"}"
	quest.3FE439111D2AF189.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.3FF9F50B6BD99394.quest_desc: [
		"Reflect damage and poison your enemy"
		"&6&lVenom Guard [Unlock Codex]"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/thorn_pendant.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
	]
	quest.3FF9F50B6BD99394.quest_subtitle: "Don’T Touch Me"
	quest.40AEB58A3D88CA54.quest_desc: [
		"Ability to drink potions faster"
		"&6&lDrink quickly【Unlock the picture book】"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/plastic_drinking_hat.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
	]
	quest.40AEB58A3D88CA54.quest_subtitle: "Chug Potions Faster"
	quest.40B3198B50FE426F.quest_desc: [
		"The &3Lumen Crystallizer&f uses lumen from nearby arrays and &bLiquid Starlight&f from its own tank to grow a cluster on top. Fill it with &bLiquid Starlight&f and Right-click it with a catalyst to choose a lumen."
		""
		"The catalyst picks the lumen."
		"- &bAevitas&f: a sapling"
		"- &3Armara&f: an ingot"
		"- &bDiscidia&f: an arrow"
		"- &3Evorsio&f: stone"
		"- &bVicio&f: a feather"
		""
		"Break the cluster by hand for a &2Lumen Crystal&f, which will shrink the cluster a stage instead of fully destroying it."
		""
		"&7&oUsing a Lumen Crystal as the catalyst means it never breaks"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Throw a &2Lumen Crystal&f, some &aStardust&f and a piece of gear into a pool of &bLiquid Starlight&f to &bbind&f that lumen to the gear. Armor, weapons and tools can all be bound."
		""
		"A binding uses charge whenever you use the item in a way that matches its aspect. Throw it back in with another &2Lumen Crystal&f of the same type to recharge it."
	]
	quest.40B3198B50FE426F.title: "&3Lumen Crystallizer"
	quest.40B67AE14F3BEE69.quest_desc: ["&6Dropped by the Wither with a 20% chance.&r While you have Azathoth, God of the Void, consume 10 of these to enable locking this Ultimate Skill in the “Lock” menu, preventing it from being lost upon reincarnation."]
	quest.40B67AE14F3BEE69.quest_subtitle: "Preserve This Skill"
	quest.40C70D05C46DCF4E.title: "&2Detector Rail"
	quest.40EE8FC6E1A4E681.quest_subtitle: "A &6Display Link&r lets you display real-time information on a connected &6Display Board&r or &6Nixie Tube&r"
	quest.40EE8FC6E1A4E681.title: "Obtain Display Link"
	quest.40FE119F7B808098.quest_desc: [
		"Botania treats flowers as more than decoration. Mystical Flowers hold an unusual abundance of magicules, gathered from the living world and shaped into mana."
		""
		"Dryads speak of Plant Whisper, an intrinsic skill for sensing and guiding plant life. Some believe Botania draws on that same affinity: perhaps these flowers are answering a familiar call."
		""
		"Begin with the Lexica Botania, then gather the materials needed to cultivate this strange flora."
	]
	quest.40FE119F7B808098.title: "Botania's Living Magic"
	quest.410667AB401D8E75.quest_desc: [
		"Use the &3Celestial Gateway&f to teleport between your bases. Every gateway with its full structure built and open sky above it can reach every other gateway, in any dimension. Dimensions without a sky count the ceiling as open sky."
		""
		"Step on the plate to see a dome of stars, where the colored ones are other gateways. Look at one and hold Right-click or Sneak while keeping your eyes on it to teleport there at no cost."
		""
		"&7&oName it in an anvil or dye it before placing to set how its star appears to everyone else"
	]
	quest.410667AB401D8E75.title: "&3Celestial Gateway"
	quest.412E9C827B7BB94E.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.413526DA9AF92A22.quest_desc: "Master Infinity Prison, then enter Raphael's Integration Mode. Hold Shift + the skill key to switch to [Evolvable] mode, then press the skill key to evolve."
	quest.413526DA9AF92A22.quest_subtitle: "Evolution Requirements"
	quest.413526DA9AF92A22.title: "&6[Advanced]&f Ultimate Skill Uriel, Lord of Vows"
	quest.413D3AECDE983AEF.quest_subtitle: "&dCulinary Ordeal"
	quest.413E7A87ADA5503C.quest_desc: [
		"&aIllumination Powder&f creates a hanging light source."
		""
		"&2Nocturnal Powder&f breaks every torch and lamp nearby and summons monsters."
		""
		"&aVivid Powder&f makes plants grow and replant themselves, and heals nearby players."
	]
	quest.413E7A87ADA5503C.title: "&aLuminous Powders"
	quest.413F740EE59BD0A1.quest_desc: [
		"This compass points you toward nearby structures. Its recipe is customized for this world:"
		"Low Magisteel Ingot | Magic Stone | Low Magisteel Ingot"
		"Medium-quality Magic Crystal | Compass | Medium-quality Magic Crystal"
		"Low Magisteel Ingot | Medium-quality Magic Crystal | Low Magisteel Ingot"
	]
	quest.413F740EE59BD0A1.quest_subtitle: "Locate the Structure"
	quest.413F740EE59BD0A1.title: "Explorer's Compass"
	quest.41423783869CBE12.quest_subtitle: "Forecast a train's arrival on your &6Display Board&r with the help of your &6Display Links&r"
	quest.41423783869CBE12.title: "&dForecasting a Train's Arrival"
	quest.41449735E77D4C2C.quest_desc: [
		"Hold a Bottle and Cork and right-click the air to fill it with Bottled Sunlight. The more you collect, the less Aura remains in the area."
		""
		"&6Using it in the Overworld, Nether, and End yields Bottled Sunlight, Bottled Ghosts, and Bottled Darkness, respectively.&r"
	]
	quest.41449735E77D4C2C.quest_subtitle: "A bottle that can hold sunlight?"
	quest.414FA15DBA09296F.quest_desc: ["Red String can link compatible blocks across a distance, allowing one block to interact with another remotely."]
	quest.414FA15DBA09296F.quest_subtitle: "Links blocks across a distance"
	quest.414FA15DBA09296F.title: "Red String"
	quest.416FB00A97CBD910.quest_desc: [
		"&6Default EP: 2000"
		"&6Equipment cannot evolve"
	]
	quest.4179A079B1184ADA.title: "{translate:\"task.9C0D1E2F3A4B5679.title\"}"
	quest.4193D1D21332AB0E.quest_desc: ["Drink an Invisibility Potion, then approach the Frost Crystal to steal it. This will wake the creature and send it into a frenzy."]
	quest.4193D1D21332AB0E.quest_subtitle: "Secretly, not for those who shoot."
	quest.41B84F355C18530C.quest_subtitle: "&7Common"
	quest.41B84F355C18530C.title: "Catch Piranha"
	quest.41BD09AC9E50B869.quest_desc: ["This creature spawns in snowfields and snowy taiga. Use an Invisibility Potion to steal the Frost Crystals it carries, or defeat it to obtain them."]
	quest.41BD09AC9E50B869.quest_subtitle: "Behemoth of the Ice Field"
	quest.41DFB924C70CC395.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.41E7CFE6CE6A85F1.quest_desc: ["This item drops from Ancient Relics. Right-click it to summon a Living Relic."]
	quest.41E7CFE6CE6A85F1.quest_subtitle: "The son of Bone Dragon?"
	quest.41EB213EC6716AFD.quest_subtitle: "&2Uncommon"
	quest.41EB213EC6716AFD.title: "Catch Neon Tetra"
	quest.4205403C9223C4B7.quest_desc: [
		"As shown in the picture, after the player presses the B key to enter the personal Skill panel, he will see some gray Skills (except resistance Skills)."
		"At this time, just click on the Skill you want to use/learn, and then click on the Skill slot in the shortcut bar to store the Skill in the shortcut bar. The operation method is the same as when equipping the Skill to the shortcut bar."
		""
		"After the setting is completed, press the corresponding Skill keys Z, X, and C to \"learn\" the Skill."
		"After Skill learning is completed, the same keys will still be used when releasing the Skill later."
		"Some skills can switch modes using ALT + the corresponding Skill key and Shift + corresponding to the Skill key."
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/skill.png width:150 height:150 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.4205403C9223C4B7.quest_subtitle: "If you don't know this, you won't succeed."
	quest.421F30004DD4F4DF.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.425E43992F71D6D5.title: "&e【Exchange】&f Bronze Coins"
	quest.426E071ABE9D9CE2.quest_desc: [
		"In order to make a train, you're going to need at least:"
		""
		"- 1 &6Train Casing&r"
		"- 1 &6Train Station&r"
		"- Enough &6Train Tracks&r to make your railroad"
		""
		"In order to see how you assemble a train, &b&lponder&r the &6Train Station&r"
	]
	quest.426E071ABE9D9CE2.title: "Obtain Sturdy Sheet"
	quest.42D4A8EEE5E25183.quest_desc: [
		"Bind the Teleportation Stone Platform to a location by Shift-right-clicking it. Then use the magic \"Space Gate\" to open the interface and select the portal icon to teleport there."
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/portal.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
		"To remove a saved location, click the exclamation mark, then quickly click the red button in the center twice."
	]
	quest.42D4A8EEE5E25183.quest_subtitle: "What is this?"
	quest.42FCA469EA5C94D7.quest_desc: [
		"&#FFED54Hyperlink:&r"
		"[ { \"text\": \"How Artifacts Work\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4DB740093C0BA804\" } } ]"
		""
		"Default Effects"
		"&5Effect 1: Unyeilding Stance"
		"Provides +5 Armor. It also provides 25% Knockback Resistance."
		"This effect is active while the artifact is equipped and the effect is unlocked."
		""
		"Refinement Bonuses"
		"Each refinement provides an additional +0.5 Armor."
		"Each refinement also provides an additional +5% Knockback Resistance."
		"Maximum: At +10 refinement, Unyeilding Stance provides +10 Armor and 75% Knockback Resistance."
	]
	quest.42FCA469EA5C94D7.title: "&6【Artifact】&f Grade 3 Ancient Artifact"
	quest.430475E11D259B74.quest_desc: [
		"The Stone Smeltery is where the Stone Smelter will smelt cobblestone into stone, stone bricks into cracked stone bricks, clay balls into bricks, clay blocks into terracotta, terracotta into glazed terracotta, all types of stone into all types of smooth stone, and logs into charcoal. They can also pop chorus fruits! "
		""
		"Be sure to teach the Stone Smelter recipes needed by your colony. Also, be sure to set a fuel type. "
	]
	quest.430475E11D259B74.quest_subtitle: "Build a Stone Smelter"
	quest.43122959460C68EA.quest_subtitle: "A &cPowered Latch&r that toggles on when receiving a redstone signal on one side and off when receiving a signal on another side"
	quest.43122959460C68EA.title: "Obtain Powered Latch"
	quest.433B669D40B0D241.quest_subtitle: "&bDemanding Dish"
	quest.434C555DDB10A971.quest_subtitle: "[Choose a route; you can also challenge them all alone.]"
	quest.43746F9C3D74259B.quest_subtitle: "&dCulinary Ordeal"
	quest.4387D3BF0F0AA32B.title: "{translate:\"task.D1E2F3A4B5C67891.title\"}"
	quest.43DB92376FFB680D.quest_desc: ["The Pure Daisy slowly transforms nearby materials: logs become Livingwood, and stone becomes Livingrock. These living materials form the foundation of Botania's devices."]
	quest.43DB92376FFB680D.title: "The Pure Daisy"
	quest.440CA931DFF4AB39.quest_subtitle: "Submit after obtaining the corresponding elf."
	quest.440CA931DFF4AB39.title: "Wind Elf•Intermediate"
	quest.44160C55DF0D7632.quest_subtitle: "For Clutches and Brakes and more!"
	quest.44160C55DF0D7632.title: "&l&cAll the things you'll need"
	quest.442080C26038D950.quest_desc: ["The Conjuration Catalyst duplicates selected materials using mana. Craft one to access its material-duplication recipes."]
	quest.442080C26038D950.quest_subtitle: "Duplicates selected materials with mana"
	quest.442080C26038D950.title: "Conjuration Catalyst"
