	quest.4876462A04B3094B.quest_desc: ["&6Dropped by Rimuru, Supermassive Slimes, and Luminous. &rConsuming it grants 10 minutes of accelerated skill learning. If you possess Great Sage, Sage, or Wisdom King, it also grants some mastery. If you possess Wisdom King or Fortune King: Fortuna, consuming 10 allows you to lock this Ultimate Skill in the “Lock” screen, preventing it from being lost upon reincarnation."]
	quest.487C3EECD8F152F5.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
