	quest.48AC8545D66B71B7.quest_desc: ["Congratulations! Getting the builder upgraded is an important step. The Builder can only build or upgrade any other hut up to the level of their own hut. So, in order for the Builder to upgrade any building, the Builder’s Hut must be upgraded first. Then the Builder will be able to upgrade any other building(s)."]
	quest.48AC8545D66B71B7.quest_subtitle: "Level Up a Builders Hut"
	quest.48C18EC1BD11BFFD.quest_desc: [
		"&8Found next to the Bone Fossil in Hell."
		"After digging it and soaking it in water for about 20 minutes, it will transform into a little evil spirit. Feeding it snowballs can speed up its growth."
	]
	quest.48C18EC1BD11BFFD.quest_subtitle: "Hatching a Music Soul"
	quest.48C51904019DBDE9.title: "Defeat the Flower of the Void"
	quest.48EF9FC96BBC47AC.title: "Ogre Shaman"
	quest.48FF65D5CA0A9DB0.quest_subtitle: "A &6Copper Backtank&r stores pressurized air for use with a diving helmet, effectively granting Water Breathing for as long as your air supply lasts"
	quest.48FF65D5CA0A9DB0.title: "Obtain Copper Backtank"
	quest.490628CE108A833A.quest_desc: [
		"The Courier runs back and forth from the Warehouse to all the worker huts in your colony, delivering materials to workers and putting finished products in the Warehouse. The level of the Courier’s Hut will dictate how many items the Courier can carry and the amount of requests they can keep track of at a time."
		""
		"Courier’s don’t just work on their own. You must build a warehouse, and assign the courier to work at a warehouse. "
		""
		"Note: If you have multiple Warehouses, Couriers will only see the items in the Warehouse they are assigned to. This is helpful in the late game when troubleshooting requests."
	]
	quest.490628CE108A833A.quest_subtitle: "Build a Courier Hut"
	quest.4913736781F06A32.title: "{translate:\"task.D1E2F3A4B5C67891.title\"}"
	quest.49234BFAD4D8AD7A.quest_desc: [
		"Drop a &2Rock Crystal&f or &3Celestial Crystal&f onto an active &3Attunement Altar&f at night to turn it into an &3Attuned Crystal&f of that &bConstellation&f."
		""
		"These are used as &bConstellation&f foci in the next tier. Some of those recipes consume the focus, so make a few for each &bConstellation&f you use."
	]
	quest.49234BFAD4D8AD7A.title: "&3Attuned Crystals"
	quest.49250178B975344D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Monsters can reproduce through food! Just feed two tamed monsters the right food to breed them.&r"
		"Any edible item: Armorsaurus, Dark Spider, Spear-Leg Armorspider"
		""
		"Meat, fish, spider eye, fermented spider eye, rabbit's foot, red mushroom, brown mushroom foods: Giant Demon Ant"
		""
		"Meat or fish: Dog Demon, Basilisk, Single-Blade Tiger, Fang Wolf, Evil Centipede, Giant Bat, Giant Cod, Giant Salmon, Leech Lizard, Sisi, Spearhorn Bull, Tempest Serpent"
		""
		"Fish: Wandering Lizard, Land Fish, One-Eyed Owl"
		""
		"Flowers: Legion Bee"
		""
		"Carrots, golden carrots, dandelions, and similar foods: Horned Rabbit"
		""
		"Hipokute foods: Cow Deer, Pegasus, Unicorn"
		""
		"Meat, fish, or cow deer meat foods: Giant Bear, Horned Bear"
		""
		"Beetroot, apples, potatoes, carrot foods: Dragon Peacock"
		""
		"Wool: Hell Moth"
		""
		"&6Some monsters spawn rarely, so keeping and breeding them is a great choice!&r"
	]
	quest.49250178B975344D.quest_subtitle: "Did you know?"
	quest.493B9FC17C3CF3CA.quest_desc: [
		"The Rabbit Hutch is where the Rabbit Herder will raise and butcher rabbits. You will have to capture and bring in two rabbits to the Rabbit Hutch, as the Rabbit Herder will not catch and bring in any rabbits."
		""
		"The Rabbit Herder will only keep two rabbits alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten rabbits in their holding pens."
		""
		"A rabbit may approach you if you hold a carrot or dandilion, but they won't follow you. Bring them back with a lead.  "
	]
	quest.493B9FC17C3CF3CA.quest_subtitle: "Build a Rabbit Hutch"
	quest.4958D7FCD507F6F7.quest_subtitle: "A &6Gearshift&r lets you reverse the direction of rotation by applying &credstone&r"
	quest.4958D7FCD507F6F7.title: "Obtain Gearshift"
	quest.496D0D622B44511D.quest_subtitle: "A &6Wand of Symmetry&r is an exceptional building tool that will mirror your actions in one, two, or four places depending on how it is configured, for both breaking and building blocks"
	quest.496D0D622B44511D.title: "Obtain Wand Of Symmetry"
	quest.497719F98AB65C4E.quest_desc: [
		"He stays next to the starlight portal, right click to talk to him."
		"&6Portal ruins can be refreshed in any group of biomes. Why not take a look at the map?&r"
		""
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/eternal_starlight/portal_ruins.png width:170 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.497719F98AB65C4E.quest_subtitle: "Not only a boss but also a businessman?"
	quest.49793060345FB28C.quest_desc: [
		"The Cowhand’s Hut is where the Cowhand will milk, breed, and butcher cows for leather. The Cowhand will only keep two cows alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten cows in their holding pens to breed and butcher."
		""
		"Note: &eYou must bring your own cows to the pen.&r"
	]
	quest.49793060345FB28C.quest_subtitle: "Build a Cowhand's Hut"
	quest.498D8E47E667D630.quest_desc: ["The Luminizer uses mana to transport entities between linked points. Set up a route to move through your base."]
