	quest.4A6D37AACDB09FA2.title: "&6【Main Story】&r EP Reaches 10,000"
	quest.4A98230B150A9D9A.quest_desc: "Build a frame like a Nether portal, craft a Time Hourglass, then right-click the frame to activate the portal and enter the dimension."
