	quest.4BB284BDFF7F4F68.quest_desc: [
		"&eAffixes&r are modifiers attached to eligible weapons and armor. Their rarity affects the number and strength of the bonuses an item can carry, from attribute improvements to combat effects and powerful abilities."
		""
		"Use an &bAugmenting Table&r to improve a chosen Affix or replace it with another of its type. Reforging instead rolls a new set of Affixes with a chosen rarity."
		""
		"&6Affix Items&r can appear in chest loot, as mob drops, and in Wandering Trader offers, so explore, fight, and check unusual trades."
		""
		"&cWorld Tiers&r are not required to access Affix equipment. With no tier ladder, item rarity comes from the item and its loot or reforging roll rather than unlocking a higher world tier."
	]
	quest.4BB284BDFF7F4F68.quest_subtitle: "Rarity-ranked bonuses for weapons and armor"
	quest.4BB284BDFF7F4F68.title: "&6Affixes and Affix Items"
	quest.4BC9A690FBB9F423.quest_desc: [
		"At the top of the Acropolis tower, you'll find an anchor. Right-click it to summon Scylla—but be prepared."
		"&6Scylla is immune to corrosion and abnormal status effects, and has body- and steel-strengthening abilities."
		""
		"Scylla has three stages. Each time her health drops by one-third, she enters the next stage."
	]
	quest.4BC9A690FBB9F423.quest_subtitle: "Woman with an Anchor"
	quest.4BC9A690FBB9F423.title: "Defeat the Siren Scylla"
	quest.4BE26323EBBC3E2B.quest_subtitle: "Requires Elf King to unlock this branch."
	quest.4C02AA6C31E0ECC6.quest_subtitle: "Floating Island in the End"
	quest.4C13F1B618B4CBEF.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.4C29C370F504DCA5.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.4C2CD6515EF0DD39.quest_subtitle: "A &6Rotational Speed Controller&r allows for fine tuning of &6RPM&r, meaning you can modify how fast or slow it will be"
	quest.4C2CD6515EF0DD39.title: "Obtain Rotation Speed Controller"
	quest.4CAB0E1CE150DBD9.quest_desc: "Dropped by Orc Disasters and Orc Lords."
	quest.4CAB0E1CE150DBD9.quest_subtitle: "The Treasured Item of the Orc Race"
	quest.4CFBD72ED6B727D5.quest_subtitle: "A gearshift that changes shaft rotation direction when powered."
	quest.4CFBD72ED6B727D5.title: "&6Inverted Gearshift"
	quest.4D396C80A4183219.quest_desc: ["&7Legend tells of a mysterious ruin hidden deep beneath an Ancient City. It leads to the Inner Earth World, a sunless place filled with monsters and rich in ores that can be mined. The pictured structure can appear in Ancient Cities, and teleportation catalysts can be found nearby."]
