	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_desc: [
		"The Combat Academy is where your Knights in Training will train to become Knight. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs."
		"The Knights in Training require a sword and shield to practice. They will attack the practice dummies, a pumpkin on top of a bale of hay."
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school"
	]
	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_subtitle: "Build a Combat Academy"
	quest.4DB740093C0BA804.quest_desc: [
		"Each artifact has a Grade, an equipment slot, an EP threshold, and one or more effects. Once an artifact reaches the required EP, the effect attached to that EP threshold becomes active. Higher-Grade artifacts are more concise and generally unlock fewer effects. Grade 1 artifacts have the most progression, with up to three effects available to unlock."
		""
		"Artifact Grades and Progression"
		"Artifacts are divided into three Grades. Each Grade determines the artifact's starting EP, effect unlock requirements, and refinement limit."
		"&6Grade 3 Artifacts"
		"- Start at 52,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their effect at 52,000 EP"
		"- Can reach up to 10 refinements"
		""
		"&6Grade 2 Artifacts"
		"- Start at 52,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their first effect at 52,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their second effect at 225,000 EP"
		"- Can reach up to 5 refinements"
		""
		"&6Grade 1 Artifacts"
		"- Start at 225,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their first effect at 225,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their second effect at 1,000,000 EP"
		"- Unlock their third effect at 5,000,000 EP"
		"- Some final effects also require the correct Unique Skill or condition"
		"- Can reach up to 3 refinements"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Artifacts are upgraded in an anvil by combining two identical artifacts."
		"The primary artifact must first be evolved far enough to qualify for the upgrade."
		"&6- Grade 3 artifacts can be upgraded after reaching 52,000 EP"
		"&6- Grade 2 artifacts can be refined after reaching 225,000 EP"
		"&6- Grade 1 artifacts can be refined after reaching 5,000,000 EP"
		"Refinement increases the strength of artifact effects. Under the current system, each refinement upgrade is randomly assigned to one valid effect."
		"Some effects have their own refinement caps. Once an effect reaches its cap, subsequent refinements are assigned to other valid effects."
	]
	quest.4DC96C29B2067A37.quest_desc: [
		"Makes you less likely to burn to death"
		"&6&lHeat Resistance [Unlock Codex]"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/curios/obsidian_skull.png width:50 height:80 align:left}"
