	quest.52413A193881CDB6.quest_desc: [
		"The &3Attunement Altar&f filters starlight down to a single &bConstellation&f, and can attune both players and &3Crystals&f. It sits in the middle of a large &2Sooty Marble&f floor under open sky, laid out as the &bTome's&f structure page shows."
		""
		"Place &2Focus Relays&f on the floor in the shape of a &bConstellation&f and hold that &bConstellation's&f paper near the altar at night to see where each relay goes. The relays link up with beams of light when the pattern is correct and the &bConstellation&f is in the sky."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Stand on the altar at night while the pattern is lit, without sneaking, to become &battuned&f and unlock your &bConstellation&f &6Perks&f."
		""
		"Perk points come from actions your &bConstellation&f favors: &bAevitas&f from building, &bArmara&f from taking damage, &bDiscidia&f from dealing damage, &bEvorsio&f from breaking blocks, and &bVicio&f from travelling."
		""
		"You can only attune to one &bConstellation&f at a time, and a &3Shifting Star&f resets it."
		""
		"For the human star-wizards who devised this rite, attunement was never dominion over the heavens. It was a way to focus one's magicules and draw closer to the celestial legacy of &6Veldanava&f, the Star-King Dragon."
	]
	quest.52413A193881CDB6.title: "&3Attunement Altar"
	quest.52453550206EC770.quest_desc: ["The Dyer's Hut is where the Dyer will craft dyes and dye other items, including red nether bricks and dark prismarine. They won't dye concrete or concrete powder, though."]
