	quest.551CEC018EF4B76D.quest_desc: [
		"Every so often, in the middle of the night, a star falls with a long bright tail and lands somewhere nearby."
		""
		"You have to find it that same night, as it's gone by dawn. Where it lands you'll find a little scatter of loot, a crystal if you were close when it hit, and an &dArtifact&f."
		""
		"Dropping the &dArtifact&f wakes it, and it starts posing riddles. Solve four to six, each stacking on the last, and it turns &6Stable&f. Leave it alone and it summons monsters, teleports around, and eventually breaks apart."
		""
		"&7&oStable Artifacts are key to later Astral Sorcery progression"
	]
	quest.551CEC018EF4B76D.title: "&dShooting Star"
	quest.551FE8D1E67DD299.title: "&6【Magic Mine Elf】&5 Digging Magic Crystal"
