	quest.57148A7A115AD70E.quest_desc: [
		"The Book of Natural Aura shows where to place everything. Find and open “Ritual of the Forest”, then select the relevant ritual diagram. Click the “eye” icon in the lower-left corner to visualize it."
		""
		"The corresponding ritual recipes can also be viewed in EMI (JEI)."
		""
		"&#FFB969To use a catalyst, craft four of them and place them on the Golden Stone Bricks at the four corners of the Natural Altar."
