	quest.5B92703EF242240B.quest_desc: [
		"&8You can join the Free Guild, but to find the route there, you need to accept and complete three dwarf commission quests. After that, you will receive a map."
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/df_q.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"After joining the guild, you can accept various commission quests from the Yuuki NPC to raise your adventurer rank, up to S rank. The higher your rank, the better the rewards! Some subjugation quests may suit you!"
		""
		"&l&4Or perhaps... stop Yuuki!"
	]
