	quest.5BB396353EB783E3.quest_subtitle: "Obtained from the alchemy dwarf."
	quest.5BC16D805F2BC6FA.quest_desc: ["&6Dropped by the Wither with a 20% chance.&r While you have Azathoth, God of the Void, consume 10 of these to enable locking this Ultimate Skill in the “Lock” menu, preventing it from being lost upon reincarnation."]
