	quest.5C06C41DE2914409.quest_desc: [
		"&eReforging&r rolls a new set of Affixes for an item using rarity materials and &6Sigils of Rebirth&r. The Simple Reforging Table handles items up to Rare; Epic and higher require a Reforging Table."
		""
		"The &bAugmenting Table&r instead lets you upgrade or reroll one individual Affix while leaving the others intact. Craft it with an Enchanting Table as the base, two Godforged Pearls, one Nether Star, and three Polished Blackstone along the bottom row."
		""
		"&6Sigils of Enhancement&r fuel the Augmenting Table's operations. Craft four Sigils from four Gem Dust, four Gem-Fused Slate, and one Godforged Pearl."
	]
