	quest.5C9134F3F3AA5C2F.quest_desc: [
		"Long pressing the activation button gives the user a floating effect similar to that of a shulker."
		""
		"&8It is not a creative flight nor a forward flight but an upward flight."
		"&6Learning can be unlocked when EP reaches 10,000"
	]
	quest.5C9134F3F3AA5C2F.quest_subtitle: "Was I beaten by a shulker?"
	quest.5C9134F3F3AA5C2F.title: "&6【Helpful Tip】&r Optional Skill [Gravity Flight]"
	quest.5CAB6913DE075CEB.quest_desc: [
		"Open the door with the Master Clock Key"
		""
		"&8It was once the core mechanism of Temporal Dawn, the center toward which all clock towers, vaults, and portals pointed. The clockmakers believed that as long as they controlled the Master Clock, they could make time obey their will: reverse wounds, instantly mature crops, and return a city to yesterday before disaster struck."
		"&8They built the Master Clock in the deepest part of the dimension, supporting its operation with countless gears, Clockstone, and Time Crystals. Every corridor was engraved with precise time formulas, and behind every door was a mechanism used to stabilize the world. Back then, the Master Clock was not a prison, but a temple dedicated to time."
		"&8Until the first \"Stasis\" occurred."
		""
		"&8When the Master Clock struck its thirteenth chime, time throughout the entire dungeon stopped."
		"&8Patrolling guards froze mid-step, burning flames solidified in the air, and the shadows of the clockmakers were pinned to the walls. Only the Master Clock kept turning, faster and faster."
		"&8No one knows where the Time Tyrant truly came from."
		"&8Some say it was the will born from the Master Clock itself."
		"&8Some say it was a monster formed from countless failed experiments, dead clockmakers, and shattered time."
		"&8Others say it was simply time's retaliation against human arrogance."
		"&8Since then, the Master Clock Dungeon has been completely sealed. The entrance responds only to the Master Clock Key, and the walls are protected by the Time Tyrant's power, making them impossible to break with ordinary tools. Anyone who tries to enter the core hall will hear a deep chime from far away, as if counting down to their own end."
		""
		"&8But the Master Clock still has not stopped."
		"&8With every turn, Temporal Dawn remains frozen."
		"&8The forests no longer truly grow, the waves no longer truly advance, and day and night have been torn into chaotic fragments. The entire dimension is trapped in the same dawn that can never end."
	]
	quest.5CAB6913DE075CEB.quest_subtitle: "The Ancient Clockmakers' Most Glorious Structure"
	quest.5CC6FEF8201DF611.quest_subtitle: "Slightly restore your magicules."
	quest.5D2866B8B177B27E.quest_subtitle: "Lets you charge certain items"
	quest.5D2866B8B177B27E.title: "Obtain Tesla Coil"
