	quest.64E1D9F1C68C4893.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Sigil of Malice&r is a rare boss-loot item that applies Malice to Affix equipment."
		""
		"It overcharges one Affix while resetting another, letting you trade one bonus for a more powerful one. This is not a general-purpose upgrade, so choose the item and the Affix you are willing to sacrifice with care."
		""
