	quest.64F520643E1E82C9.quest_subtitle: "A clutch that is only coupled if the input RPM is faster than a configurable threshold. Useful for vehicles when you have engines always on but don't want to always be moving."
	quest.64F520643E1E82C9.title: "&6Centrifugal Clutch"
	quest.64F8DC0AD541359A.quest_desc: [
		"&8The Desert Clock Tower became the first blockade. The clockmakers gave the key to the final dungeon to their strongest guard and ordered it to remain stationed on the fifth floor forever. That guard was once only a mechanical knight protecting scholars, but under the erosion of time, it gradually forgot its master..."
		""
		"Climb to the top and right-click the Clock Tower Teleporter to enter the Boss room. Do not move while teleporting, or it will fail."
	]
	quest.64F8DC0AD541359A.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the first Boss."
	quest.650CEA57092B481D.quest_subtitle: "Evolved from the Tyrant Mask"
	quest.6533548BC66DB5E7.quest_desc: [
		"After completing every quest required by the Reset Counter, use a Character Reset Scroll to perform a perfect reincarnation and gain 20 Soul Points and a new Unique Skill."
		"&4Warning: You must complete every Reset Counter requirement before using the Character Reset Scroll, or you will not receive Soul Points or a new Unique Skill."
		"&4Using a Character Reset Scroll resets your race, skills, advancements, and other character progress. Your items will not disappear!"
		""
		"&6Related Content:&r"
		"[ { \"text\": \"Introduction to Reincarnation Essence and the Reset Counter\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2E0D203C4166C35C\" } } ]"
		"[ { \"text\": \"Introduction to the Skill Locking Feature\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"166F39FFE1C98A63\" } } ]"
	]
	quest.6533548BC66DB5E7.quest_subtitle: "Reincarnate and become a higher-level existence."
	quest.6533548BC66DB5E7.title: "Complete the Reset Timer Quest"
	quest.654862122A3AD920.quest_desc: ["Right-click to summon a wisp of sand."]
	quest.654862122A3AD920.quest_subtitle: "Small Sandstorm"
	quest.6582B638965D114F.quest_subtitle: "Lets you transfer a redstone signal wirelessly within a range using a &cRedstone Link&r"
	quest.6582B638965D114F.title: "Obtain Redstone Link"
	quest.658BA859C44C25BF.quest_desc: [
		"It can be found in the structures of the main world (castles, master cartographers and villagers have a probability of refreshing the structure map), and can also be refreshed in the wild."
		""
		"&8Hostile to creatures with an EP of more than 10,000&r"
		"If you don't have strong skills or magic, please don't try to challenge her!"
		""
		"&lBOSS stage explanation:&r"
		""
		"&lfirst stage&r"
		"&6-Use basic combat skills and magic attacks."
		"&6-Has a 12.5% ​​dodge chance and may teleport when attacked."
		"&6-Skills available: Shadow Binding, Blood Blade Flashing Red Wave, Mind Control, Life and Death Embrace, Death Blessing."
		"&6-Restore 10 health points + 50 soul health points per second."
		"&6-When her HP is below 50% or Magicule is below 50%, enter the second stage.&r"
		""
		"&lSecond stage (final form)&r"
		"&6-When entering this stage, Luminas will fully recover her HP and Magicule, and clear all negative effects."
		"&6-Equip weapon: Night Rose."
		"&6-Dodge chance increased to 25%."
		"&6-Her passive health regeneration speed is increased to: 20 health points + 100 soul health points per second."
		"&6-In this phase, Luminas will use all the Skills from the first phase and additionally cast \"Atomic Collapse\":"
		"&6-During casting, the target's movement speed will be greatly slowed down."
		"&6-To cancel this Skill, you need to cause enough damage to her."
		"&6-If \"Atomic Collapse\" hits the target, the target will be killed instantly."
		""
		"&6Luminas respawns 40 minutes after being defeated."
	]
	quest.658BA859C44C25BF.quest_subtitle: "Come on, I won't run away."
	quest.658BA859C44C25BF.title: "One of the Eight-Star Demon Lords"
	quest.659CDF6941749519.quest_desc: [
		"The &aAstrolabe&f is an upgraded spyglass that displays stars during the night sky as they come into view."
		""
		"Scroll your mouse wheel while looking through it to move the angle marker on the left edge. Hold Sneak to begin drawing and trace a line from star to star following the notes you saw on your &bConstellation Paper&f."
		""
		"If every connection is right the constellation will be &bdiscovered&f, but get one wrong and nothing happens."
	]
	quest.659CDF6941749519.title: "&aAstrolabe"
	quest.65D23E7683812E26.quest_desc: [
		"What kind of a leader are you?! Your citizens are so hungry, they are eating rotten flesh! &eAre you eating rotten flesh?&r Can you spare some bread or apples for the colony? "
		""
		"It is strongly suggested that you build a restaurant and any of the 5 herding huts or a fisher’s hut. If you have those buildings already, check that buildings have the resources they need to work."
	]
