	quest.6997BE357A2624B1.quest_subtitle: "Essential for anyone working with &6&lCreate&r. &6Engineer's Goggles&r allow you to see more information about blocks, such as stress impact or contents"
	quest.6997BE357A2624B1.title: "Engineer's Goggles"
	quest.69A16C2D76C41BDE.quest_desc: [
		"It likes to live in forests, plains, and swamps, so you can try your luck in those places."
		"It is a rare creature with&m&61/1000&r&r(not that low) chance of spawning instead of normal Slime."
		"[ \"It is immune to physical ranged attacks and regenerates quickly with the Skill &4Super Speed Regeneration&r. If you cannot damage it with your current Skills, visit \", { \"text\": \"the Elves\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4835EBAC6D933CDB\" } }, \" to borrow some magic. This is a wise choice.\" ]"
		""
		"&lIts attack method:&r"
		"Deals Corrosive damage (but not the Corrosive effect), so if you have Corrosion Resistance or Corruption Immunity, you are immune to Slime's damage."
		""
		"After defeating the&bSlime Core&r, use the Slime race's innate Skill, \"Absorption and Dissolution,\" to absorb it and change your size."
	]
	quest.69A16C2D76C41BDE.quest_subtitle: "Don't touch it!"
	quest.69A16C2D76C41BDE.title: "&6【Boss Hunt①】&r The Battle Begins! Defeat the Slime King"
	quest.69A89636F2F4FCB2.quest_desc: [
		"Maybe the most tedious but also definitely the funnest &bthe Hypertube&r allows you to crawl inside the hypertunnel and zoom to the end of the tunnel at lightning speed &ano matter the shape of the tunnel&r "
		""
		"Come back once you've got all the ingredients and follow the next quest in line to build your very own &bHypertube&r"
	]
	quest.69A89636F2F4FCB2.title: "Materials for &l&bthe Hypertube"
