	quest.6BB0C51EE8CA5966.quest_desc: [
		"At the Mine, the Miner will mine for ores and materials. Once they are hired, the Miner will first create a shaft downward to a specific depth depending on the level of the Mine. Once the main shaft is completed, the Miner will then branch out. While mining, sometimes the Miner will get lucky and get an ore block instead of a basic stone block. &7&o(magic!)&r&r"
		""
		"Tip: The miner fills holes and gaps with a Fill Block, cobblestone by default. However, the fill block can be changed in the Miner’s Hut settings. If you have a forester and lots of wood, consider using wood planks. Or perhaps now you will have a use for all that deepslate."
	]
	quest.6BB0C51EE8CA5966.quest_subtitle: "Build a Mine"
	quest.6BBA95BF47D9B2AC.quest_subtitle: "A &6Rolling Mill&r is for milling raw materials into useful components, like rods and wires"
	quest.6BBA95BF47D9B2AC.title: "Obtain Rolling Mill"
	quest.6BC22C266AD65BED.quest_desc: [
		"&#FFED54Hyperlink:&r"
		"[ { \"text\": \"How Artifacts Work\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4DB740093C0BA804\" } } ]"
		""
		"Default Effects"
		"&5Effect 1: Magic Bullet Acceleration"
		"Increases the maximum charge speed of Magic Bullet to 3×."
		"This effect is active while the artifact is equipped and the effect is unlocked."
		"&5Effect 2: Ogre's Wrath"
		"When the wearer's HP is at or below 25%, Physical Damage is increased by 15%."
		"This effect is active while the artifact is equipped and the effect is unlocked."
		""
		"Refinement Bonuses"
		"Magic Bullet Acceleration Scaling"
		"Each refinement allocated to Magic Bullet Acceleration increases Magic Bullet's maximum charge speed by an additional 1×."
		"Maximum: Magic Bullet Acceleration can receive up to 2 refinements, increasing Magic Bullet's maximum charge speed to 5×."
		"Ogre's Wrath Scaling"
		"Each refinement allocated to Ogre's Wrath increases the Physical Damage bonus by an additional 2.5%."
		"Maximum: Ogre's Wrath can receive up to 2 refinements, increasing Physical Damage by up to 20% while HP is at or below 25%."
	]
	quest.6BC22C266AD65BED.title: "&6【Artifact】&f Grade 2 Ancient Artifact"
	quest.6BF28FAF8EB4389A.quest_desc: [
		"When the equipment reaches a certain EP value, it will automatically obtain a random engraving."
		"Unique engraving: 50,000 EP required"
		"Legendary engraving: 250,000 EP required"
		"Ultimate engraving: 1,000,000 EP required"
		"&6The more EP you accumulate, the higher the rarity of the engravings you can obtain."
		"With the Beyond Blessing enchantment, the equipment gains one random engraving for every 500,000 EP and for each level it gains."
		""
		"Engravings have several rarities, including Common, Rare, and Epic."
	]
	quest.6BF28FAF8EB4389A.title: "Weapon Enchantment Engraving"
