	quest.6F4B96115FE8F2AE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Instead of killing [Kingdom] with weapons, use \"own artillery with the same attributes as your current weakness\" to blast it in the [Artillery Volley] stage."
		""
		""
		"After entering the arena, you will have a weakness attribute:&bice&rand&4fire&r"
		"You can judge your current attributes by the color of the circle at the crosshair and the visual effect at the bottom of the screen."
		""
		"After every 10 uses of other Skills, the Boss uses Double Sword Hua Slash. Stand beneath the giant sword that matches your weakness attribute to reduce the damage."
	]
