	quest.72C5E74B15EFB67A.quest_subtitle: "Copy your &awritten books, enchanted books, name tags, train schedules&r and more."
	quest.72C5E74B15EFB67A.title: "&6Printer"
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_desc: [
		"Citizens will go to the Residence they are assigned to at night to sleep. The Residence is also a way to get more citizens for your colony. Every residence level adds another bed. More beds means more citizen capacity."
		""
		"It’s worth considering residence locations and the citizens they house. Workers get grumpy when they have to travel long distances to work. Try to move citizens into homes close to where they work. "
	]
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_subtitle: "Build a Residence"
	quest.72C76461BEB45CFE.quest_subtitle: "&aA Few More Steps"
	quest.73064F7E35D4E527.quest_subtitle: "&7Common"
	quest.73064F7E35D4E527.title: "Catch Sleepy Carp"
	quest.734369372F4CEB21.quest_subtitle: "&6Ultima's Table"
	quest.734B76CB88E8D2AF.quest_subtitle: "&bDemanding Dish"
	quest.739CEDD10DBE8C47.quest_subtitle: "&dCulinary Ordeal"
	quest.73C1BBF552AF3614.quest_desc: [
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/personal_panel.png width:130 height:80 align:center}"
		""
		"&lMagicules (MP):&r"
		"Magicules are gained by killing creatures. They recover naturally, through recovery potions or Silver Apples, and are fully restored upon resurrection."
		"Lower Bound: Maximum Magicules × 1.2; recovery rate × 1.25 (+25%)"
		"The End: Maximum Magicules × 1.5; recovery rate × 1.75 (+75%)"
		"Maze: Maximum Magicules +29,500; recovery rate × 2.0 (+100%)"
		"Hell: Maximum Magicules +100,000; recovery rate × 2.0 (+100%)"
		"Magicules also recover quickly in barren lands, ancient forests, miasma plains, and death deserts."
		""
		"&lEP:&r"
		"You gain EP by killing creatures. By default, you receive 3% of a creature's EP, which is allocated to Magicules or Aura based on your race. EP is your identification in this world; if you have too little, you cannot enter other worlds or groups."
		""
		"&lAura (AP):&r"
		"Aura is gained by killing creatures. It is restored naturally (2 points at a time) and fully upon resurrection. Aura is required to learn and use Qi Fighting Techniques."
		""
		"The abbreviation \"Human\" on the panel is a racial name"
		""
		"&lYour racial name is white on the normal identity panel."
		"&l&5If you are a demon, your race name on the panel is purple."
		"&l&4In Chaos, your race name is red on the panel."
		""
		"&6Souls&r: You must meet certain conditions to obtain them, such as having a&5Demon Lord Seed&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/personal_panel_2.png width:100 height:42 align:center}"
		""
		"&lSpiritual Health (SHP):&r"
		"The dark orange value beneath the health bar represents your spirit. It can be increased by evolving your race. If it reaches 0, you die."
		""
		"&lThe rest are the sky blue Magicule value and the orange Aura value.&r"
	]
	quest.73C1BBF552AF3614.quest_subtitle: "B is your friend. It will get you through hard times."
	quest.73C1BBF552AF3614.title: "Personal Panel Guide"
	quest.73C708E2C9E70F09.quest_subtitle: "&7Simple Fare"
	quest.73C78DF62012F4B2.quest_desc: [
		"Long press the right button to launch the hook, and the left button can extend the \"mysterious tentacle\" to attack the creature."
