	quest.73C8DAA9A9CBC28B.title: "Obtain Brass Casing"
	quest.73CBEFC51D900FE3.title: "Obtain Minecart Coupling"
	quest.73E1394A15979CEC.quest_desc: ["The Crimson Pendant protects its wearer from fire and lava."]
	quest.73E1394A15979CEC.quest_subtitle: "Protects against fire and lava"
	quest.73E1394A15979CEC.title: "Crimson Pendant"
	quest.7423FDFD1AC6979D.quest_desc: [
		"It has divine armor and is immune to almost all regular attacks."
		"What can really cause effective damage to it are mainly:&6Player's artillery"
	]
	quest.7423FDFD1AC6979D.quest_subtitle: "What You Need to Know"
	quest.742B53EF2F996E70.quest_subtitle: "&6Weighted Ejectors&r can launch items accurately over long distances"
	quest.742B53EF2F996E70.title: "Obtain Weighted Ejector"
	quest.742DA30B430B17C0.quest_desc: [
		"The basic lumen combine into a second tier. &dVirel&f is life and motion, &5Solyn&f is life and defense, &dCaldor&f is force, defense, and breaking, and &5Nullae&f is breaking and motion."
		""
		"Combining those gives the third tier. &dHyle&f shields and heals, &5Dynamis&f increases damage and speed, &dAion&f shortens cooldowns, and &5Akasha&f extends your reach and bundles mined drops."
		""
		"All four third-tier lumen combine into &6Prismatic&f lumen. It does nothing on its own, but bound alongside another lumen it boosts that binding at almost no upkeep. It's also used for &6Artifact Enhancement&f."
	]
	quest.742DA30B430B17C0.title: "&dPrismatic Lumen"
	quest.743339616652364F.quest_desc: [
		"Has a chance to be obtained by killing Hell Moths or Army Bees"
