	quest.7536532A088C6144.quest_subtitle: "Use this flower to locate this monster."
	quest.7536532A088C6144.title: "Looking for \"Piranha\""
	quest.7540EBEF0F004A13.quest_subtitle: "Leave a &fTrain Seat&r over 5000 blocks away from where you started travelling"
	quest.7540EBEF0F004A13.title: "&aField Trip"
	quest.75599A9909C7A8C8.quest_desc: ["Citizens need to eat in order to work. Until you have a restaurant and a steady supply of food, you will need to put a few pieces of food in their inventory. They’ll eat when they are hungry."]
	quest.7570C01FBD44131E.quest_desc: [
		"Some spots on the perk map are sockets that hold &3Dynamism Gems&f. Right-click an unlocked socket to insert a gem, and Right-click a filled one to remove it."
		""
		"Throw &aIllumination Powder&f and a &3Crystal&f into a pool of &bLiquid Starlight&f to form a gem cluster, which then grows under open sky."
		""
		"The time of day at its last growth stage decides the gem. Harvest it at full size, since it shrinks again if left unharvested for too long:"
		""
		"- Daytime makes &3Ilium&f; it has more, weaker qualities"
		"- Night makes &3Fengarum&f; it has fewer, stronger qualities"
		"- Dawn or dusk makes &3Ourium&f; it has average, well-rounded qualities"
	]
	quest.7570C01FBD44131E.title: "&3Dynamism Gems"
	quest.757AC0F85778164E.quest_subtitle: "An &6Alternator&r generates &6Energy (E)&r from kinetic energy. The amount generated is dependent on the &6RPM&r and caps at &6256 E/t&r"
	quest.757AC0F85778164E.title: "Obtain Alternator"
	quest.75CACD0EE12EFB13.quest_subtitle: "A &6Extendo Grip&r allows for increased reach for block mining and entity striking"
	quest.75CACD0EE12EFB13.title: "Obtain Extendo Grip"
	quest.75CBFD0F90772359.quest_desc: [
		"Cliches aside, the tavern should be a high priority building in the early game for several reasons. A tavern can house four colonists. Exactly the number that spawned when you created your village. "
		""
		"After completing the tavern, visitors will stop by to hang out in hopes of being recruited into your colony. You can recruit these visitors by giving them the items they request. "
		""
		"You may want to check out their stats before recruiting a visitor because nobody wants to pay too much for a rubbish colonist."
		""
		"&o&8PRO TIP: You can tell a lot about a potential recruit by looking at their boots. Fancy boots, better stats.&r&r"
	]
	quest.75CBFD0F90772359.quest_subtitle: "Build a Tavern"
	quest.75CE3E8BDEE4237D.quest_subtitle: "&5Very Rare"
	quest.75CE3E8BDEE4237D.title: "Catch Snatcher Squid"
