	quest.7699A815D2FAA05D.quest_desc: ["Different kinds of spirit charcoal can reduce alchemy time. The **Supreme Pill Scripture** is a skill that also reduces alchemy time; after learning it, you can activate it with the skill key."]
	quest.7699A815D2FAA05D.quest_subtitle: "This is the magical tool you use to refine elixirs."
