	quest.E28861E0F7CD787B.quest_desc: [
		"Botania treats flowers as more than decoration. Mystical Flowers hold an unusual abundance of magicules, gathered from the living world and shaped into mana."
		""
		"Dryads speak of Plant Whisper, an intrinsic skill for sensing and guiding plant life. Some believe Botania draws on that same affinity: perhaps these flowers are answering a familiar call."
		""
		"Begin with the Lexica Botania, then gather the materials needed to cultivate this strange flora."
	]
	quest.E28861E0F7CD787B.title: "Botania's Living Magic"
