	quest.F4F0215D6E0D5EF3.quest_desc: [
		"Your first victory proved you could withstand the Gaia Guardian—but not that you had faced its full power. In the Central Axis World, even ancient beings are capable of restraining the true value of their existence. This second rite shall draw out the Guardian's true power; it was holding back before, and now, its full might shall be brought to you to bear."
		""
		"&6&lPreparation:&r Treat this as a far more demanding rematch. Bring strong protection, a dependable source of healing, plenty of food, and mobility or resistance buffs. Keep your supplies and mana ready before beginning the rite."
		"&6&lIn the fight:&r Stay alert as the guardian changes position; do not chase blindly or linger in its purple attacks. Keep moving, recover between openings, and use deliberate strikes rather than trying to overwhelm it in one burst. Defeat this aspect to prove that your first victory was no chance encounter."
	]
	quest.F4F0215D6E0D5EF3.title: "Defeat Gaia Guardian II"
